<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Biblica® Open Kirundi Contemporary Bible (Bibiliya mu Kirundi coroshe)</book>
  <para style="rem">Copyright © 2021, 2025 by Biblica, Inc.</para>
  <para style="h">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ubutumwa Bwiza uko bwanditswe na Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ubutumwa Bwiza uko bwanditswe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohana</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Jambo yigize umuntu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Mu ntango ya vyose, Jambo yariho. Uwo Jambo yari kumwe n’Imana, kandi yari Imana. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Yari kumwe n’Imana mu ntango ya vyose. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Imana ni we yakoresheje mu kurema vyose; mu vyaremwe vyose nta na kimwe Imana yaremye itamukoresheje. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Muri we ni ho hari ubugingo, kandi ubwo bugingo bwari umuco w’abantu. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Umuco wakiye mu mwijima, ariko umwijima ntiwashoboye kuwuzimya.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Imana yatumye umuntu yitwa Yohana, <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />aza gushingira intahe uwo muco kugira ngo bose bizere kubera intahe yiwe. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Yohana ubwiwe si we yari uwo muco; ahubwo yaje ari icabona co gushingira intahe uwo umuco.<verse eid="JHN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Umuco w’ukuri wakira umuntu wese wariko uraza mw’isi. <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Jambo yari mw’isi kandi isi yaremwe na we, ariko ab’isi ntibamumenye. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Yaje mu biwe, ariko abiwe ntibamwakira. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Ariko abamwakiriye bose, bakizera izina ryiwe, yabahaye uburenganzira bwo guhinduka abana b’Imana. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Abo ntibavyawe mu buryo busanzwe, biciye mu kwipfuza kw’umubiri canke mu gushaka kw’umugabo; ahubwo bavyawe n’Imana.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Jambo yahindutse umuntu abana natwe, yuzuye ubuntu n’ukuri. Natwe twariboneye ubwiza bwiwe; ni ubwiza bw’Umwana w’ikinege, aje ava kuri Data, yuzuye ubuntu n’ukuri.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />(Yohana yamushingiye intahe aho yasemerera ati: “Uwu ni we nariko mvuga igihe navuga nti: ‘Uwuje inyuma yanje aranduta cane kuko yariho jewe ntarabaho.’ ”) <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Ibinengesereye muri we, ni vyo twese twaronseko; ni ubuntu bugeretse ku bundi. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Ivyagezwe vyatanzwe biciye kuri Mose, ariko ubuntu n’ukuri twabihawe biciye muri Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Nta muntu n’umwe yigeze abona Imana. Ariko Umwana w’ikinege, na we ubwiwe asanzwe ari Imana, akaba ari mu gikiriza ca Se, ni we yayiduhishuriye.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohana Umubatizi avuga ko atari Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Iyi ni yo ntahe Yohana yashinze igihe abakuru b’Abayuda b’i Yerusalemu bamutumako abaherezi n’Abalewi ngo bamubaze uwo ari we. <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Ntiyatinye kubishura, ahubwo yabivuze avyemanga ati: “Jewe sindi Kristo.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Na bo baramubaza bati: “None uri nde? Woba uri Eliya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Na we ati: “Sindi we.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Na bo bati: “Woba uri wa muvugishwa n’Imana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Arabishura ati: “Oya.”<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Ubwa nyuma, baravuga bati: “None uri nde? Tubwire ico tuja kwishura abadutumye. Wewe uvuga ko uri nde?”<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Nuko Yohana yishura akoresheje amajambo y’uwavugishwa n’Imana Yesaya ati: “Ndi ijwi ry’uwusemerera mu bugaragwa ati: ‘Nimugororere Uhoraho inzira.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Yesaya 40:3</ref></char></char></note>”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Mu bari barungitswe kubaza Yohana harimwo Abafarisayo. <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />Nuko baca baramubaza bati: “None nimba utari Kristo, ntube Eliya, canke uwuvugishwa n’Imana, ni kuki ubatiza?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yohana arabishura ati: “Jewe mbatiza abantu mu mazi, ariko hagati muri mwebwe hahagaze umuntu mutazi. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Uwo ni we aza inyuma yanje, ariko ntibimbereye no gupfundurura utugozi tw’ibirato vyiwe.”<verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Ivyo vyose vyabereye ahitwa Betaniya, hakurya y’uruzi Yorodani, aho Yohana yabatiriza.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohana ashingira intahe Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Ku musi ukurikira, Yohana abonye Yesu aje amutumbereye, aravuga ati: “Ng’uwu Umwagazi w’intama w’Imana, akura ivyaha vy’abari mw’isi. <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Uwu ni we navuga, igihe navuga nti: ‘Uwuje inyuma yanje aranduta cane, kuko yariho jewe ntarabaho.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Nanje ubwanje sinari ndamuzi, ariko icatumye nza mbatiza mu mazi, kwari ukugira ngo ahishurirwe Abisirayeli.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Maze Yohana ashinga intahe avuga ati: “Nabonye Mpwemu Yera amanuka ava mw’ijuru mw’ishusho y’inuma, amugumako. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Nanje ubwanje sinari ndamuzi, ariko uwantumye kubatiza mu mazi ni we yambwiye ati: ‘Uwo uzobona Mpwemu yururukirako akamugumako, ni we azobatiza abantu muri Mpwemu Yera.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Ivyo narabibonye, ni co gituma nshinga intahe ko uwo ari Umwana w’Imana.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abigishwa ba Yohana bakurikira Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Ku musi ukurikira, Yohana yari ahagaze ha handi nyene ari kumwe na babiri mu bigishwa biwe. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Abonye Yesu arengana, aravuga ati: “Ng’uwu Umwagazi w’intama w’Imana!”<verse eid="JHN 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Ba bigishwa biwe babiri bavyumvise, baca bakurikira Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesu ahindukiye, abona ko bamukurikiye. Arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Mwipfuza iki?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Baramwishura bati: “Rabi” (bisigura “Mwigisha”), “watse indaro he?”<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Nimuze muhirabire.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:39">Aho hari nk’isaha icumi. Nuko bajana na we, babona aho yatse indaro, baca bamarana na we uwo muhingamo.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Umwe muri ba bigishwa babiri bumvise ivyo Yohana yavuze bagaca bakurikira Yesu, yitwa Andereya kandi yavukana na Simoni Petero. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Nuko Andereya aca aja kurondera mwene nyina Simoni, amubwira ati: “Twabonye Mesiya” (bisigura Kristo). <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Maze aca amuzana aho Yesu ari.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Nuko Yesu yihweza Petero, aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Uri Simoni mwene Yohana, ariko ugiye kwitwa Kefa”</char> (bisigura Petero).<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahamagara Filipo na Natanayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Ku musi ukurikira, Yesu afata ingingo yo kuja i Galilaya. Ariko aragenda, ahura na Filipo, amubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nkurikira!”</char><verse eid="JHN 1:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filipo yava mu gisagara citwa Betesayida, ari na co Andereya na Petero bavamwo. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Nuko Filipo asanga Natanayeli aho ari, amubwira ati: “Twabonye umwe Mose yavugako mu Vyagezwe, n’abavugishwa n’Imana bakamwandikako. Ni Yesu w’i Nazareti, mwene Yosefu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natanayeli aramubaza ati: “Hari iciza cova i Nazareti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Filipo aramwishura ati: “Ingo uvyirabire.”<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Yesu abonye Natanayeli aje amutumbereye, amuvugako ati: <char style="wj">“Ng’uwu Umwisirayeli w’ukuri agororotse mu mutima.”</char><verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanayeli aca amubaza ati: “Wamenye gute?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Igihe wari wicaye musi y’igiti c’umusukoni, imbere yuko Filipo aguhamagara, nakubona.”</char><verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Natanayeli aca aravuga ati: “Rabi, uri Umwana w’Imana, uri Umwami wa Isirayeli.”<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Wizeye kubera nakubwiye ko nakubonye igihe wari wicaye musi y’igiti c’umusukoni? Uzobona ibihambaye kurusha ivyo.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Yongerako ati: <char style="wj">“Ndababwire ukuri, muzobona ijuru ryuguruye, abamarayika b’Imana baduga bongera bamanuka ku Mwana w’Umuntu.”</char><verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahindura amazi umuvinyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Haciye imisi ibiri, haba ubukwe ahantu hitwa Kana i Galilaya, kandi nyina wa Yesu ni ho yari. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Yesu n’abigishwa biwe na bo bari batumiwe muri ubwo bukwe. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Umuvinyu uheze urubanza rutarahera, Mariya nyina wa Yesu abwira Yesu ati: “Nta muvinyu basigaranye.”<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Muvyeyi, kuki ugomba kunshira muri ivyo bintu? Igihe canje ntikirashika.”</char><verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Ariko Mariya abwira abakozi ati: “Ico ababwira cose mugikore.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Hafi yaho hari impange z’amazi zibajwe mu mabuye Abayuda bakoresha mu mugenzo wabo wo kwihumanura, kandi impange imwe yashobora kwuzuzwa n’ibibindi bibiri canke bitatu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amalitiro 115</char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesu abwira abakozi ati: <char style="wj">“Nimwuzuze izo mpange amazi.”</char> Nuko barazuzuza gushika ku mbiga.<verse eid="JHN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Maze arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nimudaheko mushire umuteretsi.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 2:8">Na bo babikora nk’uko ababwiye. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Nuko wa muteretsi yumvirije ayo mazi yahindutse umuvinyu. Ntiyari azi uko vyagenze, ariko abakozi bayadashe bo bari babizi, aca ahamagara umukwe, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />amubwira ati: “Abandi bantu bose batanga umuvinyu uryoshe cane ubwa mbere, hanyuma abatumire bamaze guhimba, bagatanga uwutaryoshe cane; ariko wewe wagumye uzimana uwuryoshe gushika n’ubu!”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Iki ni co gitangaza ca mbere Yesu yakoze, akaba yagikoreye i Kana mu ntara ya Galilaya. Uko ni ko Yesu yerekanye icubahiro ciwe, maze abigishwa biwe baramwizera.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Hanyuma y’ivyo, Yesu aja i Kaperinawumu ari kumwe na nyina, na bene nyina n’abigishwa biwe, bahamara imisi mike.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yirukana abadandariza mu rusengero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Imisi mikuru ya Pasika y’Abayuda yegereje, Yesu aduga i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Ashitse mu rusengero, ahasanga abantu bariko baradandaza inka, intama n’inuma; n’abandi bicaye bariko baravunja amahera ku meza. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Yesu atora imigozi arayitsiba imera nk’inkoni, yirukana abantu bose mu rusengero, asohora n’intama n’inka, asanzaza ibiceri vy’abavunja amahera, atembagariza n’imeza zabo hasi. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Abariko baragurisha inuma arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Sohora ibi bintu! Reka guhindura inzu ya Data isoko!”</char> <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Abigishwa biwe baca baribuka ijambo ryo mu Vyanditswe Vyera rivuga ngo: “Ishaka mfitiye inzu yawe ryaka muri jewe nk’umuriro.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Zaburi 69:9</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Abayuda baramubaza bati: “Ni ikihe kimenyetso ukora kitwereka ububasha ufise bwo gukora ibi?”<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Nimusambure uru rusengero, nanje ndarwubaka mu misi itatu.”</char><verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Na bo baramwishura bati: “Kwubaka uru rusengero vyafashe imyaka mirongo ine n’itandatu, none nawe uvuga ko worwubaka mu misi itatu?” <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Ariko Yesu yavuze urusengero, ashaka kuvuga umubiri wiwe. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Amaze kuzuka, abigishwa biwe baciye bibuka ko ivyo yari yarabivuze, baca bizera Ivyanditswe n’amajambo Yesu yari yaravuze.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Yesu ari i Yerusalemu ku Musi mukuru wa Pasika, abantu benshi baramwizeye babonye ibitangaza akora. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Ariko Yesu ntiyabizigira kuko yari azi imitima yabo bose. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Ntiyari akeneye ko bamubwira uko umuntu ameze, kuko yari azi ibiri mu mutima w’umuntu wese.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Nikodemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Hari umuntu yitwa Nikodemu, yari Umufarisayo akaba n’umwe mu bagize inama nkuru y’idini ry’Abayuda. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Umusi umwe aza kuraba Yesu mw’ijoro aramubwira ati: “Mwigisha, turazi ko uri umwigisha yavuye ku Mana, kuko nta muntu yoshobora gukora ibitangaza ukora, Imana itari kumwe na we.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ndakubwire ukuri, nta muntu n’umwe ashobora kubona Ubwami bw’Imana, atavutse ubwa kabiri.”</char><verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodemu aramubaza ati: “Mbega umuntu ashaje yoshobora kuvuka ubwa kabiri gute? Yoshobora gusubira mu nda ya nyina, akongera akavuka?”<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ndakubwire ukuri, nta muntu n’umwe ashobora kwinjira mu Bwami bw’Imana atavyawe n’amazi na Mpwemu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" /><char style="wj">Umubiri uvyara umubiri, ariko Mpwemu avyara impwemu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" /><char style="wj">Ntutangazwe n’uko ndakubwiye nti: ‘Utegerezwa kuvuka ubwa kabiri.’</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" /><char style="wj">Umuyaga uhuhutira aho ushaka, wewe ukumva uhuhuta gusa, ariko ntushobora kumenya iyo uzanana canke iyo uja. Uko ni ko bimera no ku wuvyawe na Mpwemu.”</char><verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodemu aramubaza ati: “None ivyo bishoboka bite?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Wewe ko uri umwigisha yubashwe muri Isirayeli, bigenda gute ngo ntutahure ivyo bintu?</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" /><char style="wj">Ndakubwire ukuri, twebwe tuvuga ivyo tuzi, kandi dushingira intahe ivyo twabonye, ariko ntimwemera intahe yacu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" /><char style="wj">Nimba nababwiye ibintu vyo kw’isi ntimwizere, mwoshobora mute kwizera ndababwiye ivyo mw’ijuru?</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" /><char style="wj">Nta n’umwe arigera aduga mw’ijuru, kiretse Umwana w’Umuntu yamanutse avayo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" /><char style="wj">Nk’uko Mose yamanitse inzoka ku giti mu bugaragwa, ni ko n’Umwana w’Umuntu ategerezwa kumanikwa,</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" /><char style="wj">kugira ngo uwumwizera wese aronke ubugingo budashira.</char><verse eid="JHN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />
    <char style="wj">Kuko Imana yakunze abari kw’isi cane, bituma itanga Umwana wayo w’ikinege, kugira ngo uwumwizera wese ntazoranduke, ahubwo aronke ubugingo budashira.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" /><char style="wj">Erega Imana ntiyatumye Umwana wayo kw’isi gucira urubanza abari kw’isi, ahubwo yamutumye kugira ngo ibakize biciye muri we.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" /><char style="wj">Uwizeye Umwana w’Imana ntashobora gutsindwa n’urubanza. Ariko uwutamwizera wese aramaze gutsindwa n’urubanza, kuko atizeye izina ry’Umwana w’ikinege w’Imana.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" /><char style="wj">Iki ni co kibatsindisha: umuco waje mw’isi, ariko abantu bakunda umwijima kuruta umuco, kuko ibikorwa vyabo ari bibi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" /><char style="wj">Umuntu wese akora ibibi yanka umuco, kandi ntiyegera umuco kuko atinya ko ibikorwa vyiwe bibi bija ahabona.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" /><char style="wj">Ariko umuntu wese akora ivy’ukuri yegera umuco, kugira ngo bigaragare ko ivyo akora abikorera mu kwubaha Imana.”</char><verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohana yongera gushingira intahe Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Hanyuma y’ivyo, Yesu ajana n’abigishwa biwe mu ntara ya Yudaya, agumana na bo igihe ariko arabatiza. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Ico gihe Yohana na we yariko arabatiriza ahitwa Ayinoni hafi y’i Salimu, kuko hari amazi menshi, kandi abantu baguma baza kubatizwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Aho hari imbere yuko Yohana atabwa mw’ibohero. <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Bamwe mu bigishwa ba Yohana batangura guharira n’uwundi Muyuda umwe ku bijanye n’umugenzo wo kwihumanura. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Nuko baza aho Yohana ari bamubwira bati: “Rabi, wa muntu yari kumwe na we hakurya y’uruzi Yorodani, umwe washingira intahe, ariko arabatiza kandi abantu bose baja iyo ari.”<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yohana arabishura ati: “Nta co muntu ashobora kuronka atagihawe kivuye mw’ijuru ku Mana. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Mwebwe ubwanyu muri ivyabona ko navuze nti: ‘Jewe sindi Kristo, ahubwo natumwe kumutegurira inzira.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Erega umugeni ni uw’umukwe. Ariko umugenzi ahagarikiye umukwe amuhagarara i ruhande akamwumviriza, akanezerwa no kwumva ijwi ryiwe. Uwo ni wo munezero wanje kandi uruzuye. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Akwiye kurushiriza kuba mukuru, nanje nkarushiriza kuba muto.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Uwamanutse ava mw’ijuru aruta bose, uwaje ava kw’isi ni uw’isi kandi avuga nk’uw’isi nyene, ariko uwaje ava mw’ijuru aruta bose. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Uwo ashingira intahe ivyo yabonye n’ivyo yumvise, yamara nta n’umwe yemera intahe yiwe. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Ariko uwemera intahe yiwe wese aba yemeje ko Imana ivuga ukuri. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Uwo Imana yatumye avuga amajambo y’Imana, kuko Imana imuha Mpwemu itamupimiye. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Se arakunda Umwana kandi yamuhaye kuganza vyose. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Uwizera Umwana afise ubugingo budashira, ariko uwutamwizera ntazoronka ubugingo budashira, ahubwo uburake bw’Imana buguma kuri we.”<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu avugana n’Umusamariyakazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Nuko Yesu yumva ko Abafarisayo bamenye ko aronka kandi abatiza abigishwa benshi kurusha Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Ariko Yesu ubwiwe si we yabatiza, ahubwo abigishwa biwe ni bo babatiza. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Nuko aca ava i Yudaya asubira i Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Mu kujayo, vyabaye ngombwa ko aca i Samariya. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Nuko ashika mu gisagara c’i Samariya citwa Sukara, hafi y’itongo Yakobo yari yarahaye umuhungu wiwe Yosefu. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Aho ni ho hari iriba rya Yakobo. Yesu aruhijwe n’urugendo, yicara kuri iryo riba. Aho hari nk’isaha zitandatu z’umurango.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Nuko haza umugore w’Umunyasamariyakazi kuvoma amazi, Yesu aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Wompa amazi yo kunywa?”</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />(Ico gihe, abigishwa biwe bari bagiye mu gisagara kurondera ivyokurya.)<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Wa Musamariyakazi aramubwira ati: “Wewe uri Umuyuda nanje ndi Umusamariyakazi. Bigenda gute ngo unsabe amazi yo kunywa?” (Mu bisanzwe, Abayuda n’Abasamariya baranenana.)<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Iyo uba wari uzi ingabire y’Imana, akamenya n’uwugusavye amazi yo kunywa uwo ari we, wari kumusaba na we akaguha amazi y’ubugingo.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Wa mugore aramwishura ati: “Nyakwubahwa, nta co ufise co kuvomesha kandi iriba ni rirerire. Ayo mazi y’ubugingo woyakura he? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Wewe uruta sogokuruza Yakobo yaduhaye iri riba kandi na we ubwiwe akanywa amazi yaryo, n’abana biwe n’ibitungwa vyiwe?”<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Umuntu wese anywa kuri ayo mazi azosubira kugira inyota,</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" /><char style="wj">ariko uwunywa amazi ntanga ntazosubira kugira inyota. Ahubwo ayo mazi azohinduka isoko ridudubiza muri we, rizana ubugingo budashira.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Wa mugore aramubwira ati: “Nyakwubahwa, mpa kuri ayo mazi kugira ngo sinzosubire kunyoterwa ngo name nza ngaha kuvoma.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesu aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Genda uhamagare umugabo wawe uce ugaruka.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Aramwishura ati: “Nta mugabo mfise.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Yesu aca amubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Uvuze ukuri! Nta mugabo ufise.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" /><char style="wj">Kuko wabanye n’abagabo batanu, kandi n’uwo muri kumwe ubu si umugabo wawe. Ivyo uvuze ni ukuri.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Wa mugore aramwishura ati: “Nyakwubahwa, ndabona ko uri uwuvugishwa n’Imana. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Ba sogokuruza basengera kuri uwu musozi, ariko mwebwe Abayuda muvuga ko ikibanza co gusengeramwo ari i Yerusalemu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Mupfasoni, nunyizere: igihe kiraje aho mutazorinda kuja gusengera Data kuri uriya musozi canke i Yerusalemu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" /><char style="wj">Mwebwe Abasamariya musenga ico mutazi, ariko twebwe dusenga ico tuzi, kuko agakiza gaturuka mu Bayuda.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" /><char style="wj">Ariko igihe kiraje kandi kirashitse aho abasenga b’ukuri bazosenga Data mu Mpwemu no mu kuri. Abo ni bo basenzi Data arondera.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" /><char style="wj">Imana ni impwemu, kandi abayisenga bakwiye kuyisenga mu Mpwemu no mu kuri.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Wa mugore aravuga ati: “Ndazi ko Mesiya (yitwa Kristo) azoza. Niyaza, azodusobanurira vyose.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesu aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Uwo Kristo, ni Jewe nyene turiko tuvugana.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abigishwa bagaruka aho Yesu ari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Muri ako kanya, abigishwa biwe baragaruka, maze batangazwa cane no kubona Yesu ariko avugana n’umugore. Ariko ntihagira uwubahuka kumubaza ati: “Ushaka iki?” canke ati: “Ni kuki uvugana n’uwo mugore?”<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Wa mugore asiga umubindi wiwe kw’iriba, asubira mu gisagara, abarira abantu ati: <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Nimuze murabe umuntu yambwiye ivyo nakoze vyose. Ashobora kuba ari we Kristo.” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Nuko baca barasohoka bava mu gisagara baja iyo Yesu ari.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Muri ico gihe, abigishwa bariko baramwinginga bati: “Rabi, gira ico ufunguye.”<verse eid="JHN 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Ariko arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ndafise ivyokurya mwebwe mutazi.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Abigishwa barabazanya bati: “Mbega hari uwoba yamuzaniye ivyokurya?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ivyokurya vyanje ni ugukora ivyo uwantumye agomba, no guheraheza igikorwa ciwe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" /><char style="wj">Mbega ntimuvuga ngo: ‘Hasigaye amezi ane ngo iyimbura rishike’? Umve ndababwire, nimwunamure amaso yanyu murabe! Imirima ireze, igeze kwimbura.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" /><char style="wj">N’ubu, uwimbura ariko arahabwa impembo yiwe kandi ariko aregeraniriza ivyimburwa mu bugingo budashira, kugira ngo uwubiba n’uwimbura bazonezeranwe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" /><char style="wj">Kuko wa mugani uvuga ukuri ngo: ‘Umwe arabiba, uwundi akimbura.’</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" /><char style="wj">Nabarungitse kwimbura aho mutabiriye akuya. Abandi baracumukuye, none ni mwebwe mwironkeye inyungu mu buruhe bwabo.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abasamariya benshi bizera Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Nuko Abasamariya benshi bo muri ico gisagara bizera Yesu kubera wa mugore yababwiye ati: “Yambwiye ivyo nakoze vyose.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Bashitse aho ari, baramwinginga ngo agumane na bo, maze ahamara imisi ibiri. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Kandi kubera amajambo yiwe, n’abandi benshi barizera.<verse eid="JHN 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Babwira wa mugore bati: “Ubu ntitucizeye kubera ivyo watubwiye gusa; kuko twamwiyumviye, kandi twamenye neza ko ari we Mukiza w’isi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu akiza umwana w’umutware</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Haheze imisi ibiri, Yesu ava i Samariya aja i Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />(Yesu ubwiwe yari yaravuze ko ata wuvugishwa n’Imana yemerwa n’abo iwabo.) <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Ashitse i Galilaya, Abanyagalilaya baramwakira. Bari barabonye ivyo yakoreye i Yerusalemu ku Musi mukuru wa Pasika, kuko ari yo bari bari.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Yongera kuja i Kana mu ntara ya Galilaya, hamwe yahindura amazi umuvinyu. Aho hari umutware yakora i bwami yari afise umuhungu agwariye i Kaperinawumu. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Yumvise ko Yesu yashitse i Galilaya avuye i Yudaya, aja iyo ari aramwinginga ngo aje i Kaperinawumu amukirize umuhungu wiwe yari ku mpfiro.<verse eid="JHN 4:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesu aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega ntimushobora kwizera mutabonye ibimenyetso n’ibitangaza?”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Wa mutware akora i bwami aramubwira ati: “Nyakwubahwa, ingo tujane iwanje umwana wanje ataracikana.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Nutahe, umwana wawe ni muzima.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Nuko wa muntu yizera amajambo ya Yesu, aca arataha. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Akiri mu nzira, abakozi biwe baza kumusanganira bamubwira ko umuhungu wiwe ari muzima. <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Ababajije igihe umuhungu wiwe yakiriye, bamubwira bati: “Ejo isaha indwi z’umuhingamo ni ho umururumbo wahera.”<verse eid="JHN 4:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Se w’umwana aca asanga hari kuri ya saha Yesu yamubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Umwana wawe ni muzima.”</char> Nuko aca yizera Yesu we n’abo mu nzu yiwe bose.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Iki cabaye igitangaza ca kabiri Yesu yakoze agarutse i Galilaya avuye i Yudaya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu akiza umuntu ku kidengeri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Hanyuma y’ivyo, Yesu aduga i Yerusalemu ku musi mukuru w’Abayuda. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Aho i Yerusalemu, hafi y’Irembo ry’Intama, hariho ikidengeri citwa Betezata mu rurimi rw’Igiheburayo, cari gikikujwe n’amabaraza atanu. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Muri ayo mabaraza, hari haryamye abarwayi benshi, harimwo abatabona, abacumbagira, n’abanyunyutse. [Bari barindiriye ko amazi azikuruka. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Kuko rimwe na rimwe umumarayika w’Umwami Imana yaramanuka akazikurura amazi. Maze uwa mbere aterewe muri ico kidengeri amazi azikurutse, yaca akira ingwara iyo ari yo yose yaba agwaye.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu nzandiko zimwezimwe za Bibiliya aya majambo ntarimwo.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Umwe muri bo, yari amaze imyaka mirongo itatu n’umunani agwaye. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yesu amubonye aryamye aho, akamenya n’uko amaze igihe kirekire agwaye, aramubaza ati: <char style="wj">“Urashaka gukira?”</char><verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Wa muntu agwaye aramwishura ati: “Nyakwubahwa, nta muntu mfise wo kunterera mu kidengeri iyo mazi azikurutse; kuko nkiriko ndagerageza kujayo, nsanga hari uwantanzeyo.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Maze Yesu aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Haguruka, ikorere ikirago cawe ugende.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Ubwo nyene wa muntu arakira, aterura ikirago ciwe, aragenda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Ivyo vyabaye ku musi w’Isabato. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Abakuru b’Abayuda babwira wa muntu yakize bati: “Uwu ni umusi w’Isabato; ivyagezwe ntibikwemerera kwikorera ikirago cawe.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Arabishura ati: “Umuntu yankijije ni we yambwiye ati: <char style="wj">‘Ikorere ikirago cawe ugende.’</char> ”<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Na bo baramubaza bati: “Ni nde yakubwiye ngo wikorere ikirago cawe ugende?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Wa muntu yakize ntiyari azi uwamukijije awo ari we, kuko Yesu yaciye yigira, kandi aho hantu hari abantu benshi.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Mu nyuma, Yesu amusanga mu rusengero aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Urabona ko wakize! Ntuze usubire gucumura kugira ngo ntuze ushikirwe n’icago kirengeye ico wahorana.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Wa muntu aca aragenda abwira ba bakuru b’Abayuda ko ari Yesu yamukijije.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ububasha bw’Umwana w’Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Nuko abakuru b’Abayuda batangura guhama Yesu, kuko yakoze ivyo ku musi w’Isabato. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Ariko Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Gushika n’ubu Data ariko arakora; kandi nanje ndiko ndakora.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Ivyo vyatumye Abayuda barushiriza kurondera ingene bomwica; kuko uretse kutubahiriza Isabato, yavuze ko Imana ari Se, gutyo yigira uwungana n’Imana.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ndababwire ukuri, Umwana nta co ashobora gukora acigeneye, ariko akora ico abonye Se akora gusa. Ico se akora, ni co n’Umwana akora.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" /><char style="wj">Kuko Se arakunda Umwana akamwereka ivyo ariko arakora vyose. Ndetse azomwereka ibikorwa bikomeye kuruta ibi, kugira ngo mwumirwe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" /><char style="wj">Kuko nk’uko Data azura abapfuye akabaha ubugingo, ni ko n’Umwana aha ubugingo uwo ashatse kubuha.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" /><char style="wj">Vyongeye, Data nta muntu acira urubanza. Ahubwo yahaye Umwana ububasha bwose bwo guca imanza,</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" /><char style="wj">kugira ngo bose bubahe Umwana nk’uko bubaha Se. Uwutubaha Umwana, ntiyubaha na Se yamutumye.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />
    <char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, umuntu wese yumva ijambo ryanje, akizera uwantumye, afise ubugingo budashira. Kandi uwo ntazotsindwa n’urubanza, ahubwo aramaze kuva mu rupfu aja mu bugingo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" /><char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, igihe kiraje kandi kirashitse, aho abapfuye bazokwumva ijwi ry’Umwana w’Imana kandi abazoryumva bazogira ubugingo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" /><char style="wj">Nk’uko Data afise ubugingo muri we, ni ko yahaye Umwana kugira ubwo bugingo muri we.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" /><char style="wj">Kandi yamuhaye ububasha bwo guca imanza kuko ari Umwana w’Umuntu.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />
    <char style="wj">Ibi ntibibatangaze, kuko igihe kiraje aho abari mu mva bose bazokwumva ijwi ryiwe,</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" /><char style="wj">hanyuma bazuke. Abakoze ivyiza, bazozukira ubugingo, abakoze ibibi na bo bazukire gutsindwa n’urubanza.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" /><char style="wj">Jewe nta co nshobora gukora nigeneye. Nca urubanza nkurikije ivyo Data ambwiye gusa, kandi urubanza rwanje ruragororotse, kuko ntakora ivyo nigombeye, ahubwo nkora ivyo uwantumye agomba.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibishingira intahe Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />
    <char style="wj">Nimba nishingira intahe, intahe yanje si iy’ukuri.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" /><char style="wj">Hari uwundi anshingira intahe, kandi ndazi ko intahe anshingira ari iy’ukuri.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />
    <char style="wj">Mwatumye intumwa kuri Yohana, kandi intahe yanshingiye ni iy’ukuri.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" /><char style="wj">Si ukuvuga ko nkeneye intahe z’abantu; ariko ibi ndabivuze kugira ngo mukizwe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" /><char style="wj">Yohana yari nk’itara ryaka rikabonesha, kandi mwamaze igihe munezererewe umuco wiwe.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />
    <char style="wj">Intahe mfise iraruta iya Yohana. Kuko ibikorwa Data yampaye gushitsa ari na vyo ndiko ndakora, bishinga intahe ko ari Data yantumye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" /><char style="wj">Kandi na Data yantumye ubwiwe aranshingira intahe. Ntimurigera mwumva ijwi ryiwe canke ngo mumubone amaso mu yandi,</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" /><char style="wj">kandi n’ijambo ryiwe ntiriguma muri mwebwe, kuko mutizera uwo yatumye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" /><char style="wj">Mwiga Ivyanditswe n’umwete mwinshi kuko mwibaza ko bishobora kubaha ubugingo budashira. Ivyo Vyanditswe nyene ni vyo binshingira intahe,</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" /><char style="wj">yamara ntimushaka kuza aho ndi ngo muronke ubwo bugingo.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />
    <char style="wj">Jewe sindondera gushimwa n’abantu,</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" /><char style="wj">kuko ndabazi, ndazi ko ata gukunda Imana kuri mu mitima yanyu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" /><char style="wj">Naje mw’izina rya Data, ariko ntimwanyakira; yamara nihagira uwundi aza mw’izina ryiwe ubwiwe, muzomwakira.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" /><char style="wj">Mbega mwokwizera gute kandi murondera gushimana hagati yanyu, aho kurondera gushimwa n’Imana imwe rudende?</char><verse eid="JHN 5:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />
    <char style="wj">Ariko ntimwibaze ko ari jewe nzobagiriza imbere ya Data. Uwubagiriza ni Mose, uwo mwizigiye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" /><char style="wj">Iyo mwizera Mose, nanje mwonyizeye, kuko yanditse avuga kuri jewe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" /><char style="wj">None nimba mutizera ivyo yanditse, mwokwizera gute amajambo yanje?”</char><verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu agaburira abantu ibihumbi bitanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Hanyuma y’ivyo, Yesu arajabuka aja ku ruhande rwo hakurya y’ikiyaga c’i Galilaya (ari co kiyaga c’i Tiberiya). <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Abantu isinzi baramukurikira kuko bari babonye ibitangaza yari yakoze mu gukiza abagwaye. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Nuko Yesu aduga ku musozi yicarana n’abigishwa biwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Ico gihe Umusi mukuru wa Pasika w’Abayuda wari wegereje.<verse eid="JHN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Yesu abonye abantu benshi baje bamutumbereye, abarira Filipo ati: <char style="wj">“Ni hehe twogurira ivyokurya vyo kugaburira aba bantu bose?”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Yabajije ico kibazo nk’uwumugeza, kuko we yari azi ico agiye gukora.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filipo aramwishura ati: “Naho tworonka idenariyo amajana abiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yari impembo y’umukozi mu mezi 8.</char></note>, ntitwokuramwo ivyokurya bikwiye n’umutamiro w’umwumwe.”<verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Umwe mu bigishwa biwe yitwa Andereya, yavukana na Simoni Petero, abwira Yesu ati: <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Hano hariho umuhungu afise imikate y’ingano itanu n’ifi zibiri. Ariko vyomara iki ku bantu bangana uku?”<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesu aravuga ati: <char style="wj">“Nimubicarike.”</char> Aho hantu hari ubwatsi bwinshi. Nuko abo bantu baricara (abagabo bonyene bashika nk’ibihumbi bitanu). <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Yesu afata ya mikate, ayishimira Imana, ayiha abari bicaye ngaho. Na za fi azigenza uko. Abantu bararya nk’uko babishaka.<verse eid="JHN 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Bamaze guhaga bose, Yesu abwira abigishwa biwe ati: <char style="wj">“Nimwegeranye utumanyu twasigaye, ntihagire igipfa ubusa.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Nuko begeranya utumanyagu twa ya mikate itanu y’ingano abantu bariye, buzuza ibiseke cumi na bibiri.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Abantu babonye igitangaza Yesu akoze baravuga bati: “Ni ivy’ukuri uwu ni wa muvugishwa twari twiteze kw’isi.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yesu amenye ko bagira baze ngo bamwimike ku nguvu nk’umwami, aca asubira ku musozi ari wenyene.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu agendera ku mazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Bugorovye, abigishwa ba Yesu bamanuka ku kiyaga, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />burira ubwato kugira ngo bajabuke baje i Kaperinawumu. Aho rero hari hamaze kuza umuzimagiza kandi Yesu ntiyari bwabashikire. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Ico gihe, umuyaga wariko urahuhuta cane bituma haba imipfunda myinshi mu kiyaga. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Bamaze gusoza nka sitadiyo mirongo ibiri na zitanu canke mirongo itatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilometero 5 canke 6.</char></note>, babona Yesu agendagenda ku mazi yegera ubwato barimwo, maze bagira ubwoba. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ni jewe. Ntimugire ubwoba.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Nuko bashaka kumwuriza mu bwato, ariko buba burashitse ku nkengera aho bari bagiye.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Ku musi ukurikira, hariho abantu benshi bari basigaye hakurya y’ikiyaga, maze bibuka ko hariho ubwato bumwe bwonyene abigishwa bagiyemwo, kandi ko Yesu atinjiranye n’abigishwa biwe muri bwo. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Ico gihe ubundi bwato bwinshi buvuye i Tiberiya, bwariko buraza bushika hamwe Umwami Yesu yahezagirira imikate abantu bakayifungura. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Maze abantu babonye ko Yesu n’abigishwa biwe atari ho bari, baca binjira muri ubwo bwato baja i Kaperinawumu kumuronderayo.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ni umukate w’ubugingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Bamusanze aho yari hakurya y’ikiyaga, baramubaza bati: “Mwigisha, washitse hano ryari?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ndababwire ukuri, ntimuriko mundondera kubera mwatahuye ibitangaza mwabonye nkora, ahubwo mundondera kuko nabagaburiye imikate mugahaga.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" /><char style="wj">Ntimugakorere ivyokurya bibora, ahubwo nimukorere ivyokurya bihoraho kandi bitanga ubugingo budashira, ivyo Umwana w’Umuntu azobaha, kuko Imana Data ari we yahaye ububasha bwo gukora ivyo.”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Baramubaza bati: “Natwe turashaka gukora ibikorwa vy’Imana. None tubigenze gute?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Iki ni co gikorwa Imana ishaka ko mukora: nimwizere uwo yatumye.”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Baramubwira bati: “Mbega nta gitangaza wokora kugira ngo tukibone hanyuma twizere? Ni ikihe wokora? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Ba sogokuruza bacu baririye manu mu bugaragwa, kuko Ivyanditswe Vyera bivuga biti: ‘Mose yabahaye imikate ivuye mw’ijuru ngo bayirye.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 16:4">Kuvayo 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:15">Nehemiya 9:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24">Zaburi 78:24</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 78:25">25</ref></char></char></note>”<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ndababwire ukuri, Mose si we yabahaye imikate ivuye mw’ijuru, ariko Data ni we yayibahaye, kandi ni we abaha umukate w’ukuri uvuye mw’ijuru.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" /><char style="wj">Kuko umukate w’Imana ni uwumanuka uvuye mw’ijuru ugaha isi ubugingo.”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Baramubwira bati: “Nyakwubahwa, turagusavye wame uduha uwo mukate imisi yose.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ni jewe mukate w’ubugingo. Uwuza aho ndi ntazosubira gusonza, kandi uwunyizera ntazosubira kunyoterwa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" /><char style="wj">Ariko nk’uko nabibabwiye, muramaze kumbona yamara ntimurizera.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" /><char style="wj">Ariko abo Data yampaye bose bazoza aho ndi kandi sinzokwigera nirukana uwuje aho ndi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" /><char style="wj">Kuko sinamanutse mva mw’ijuru nje gukora ivyo nshaka, ariko nazanywe no gukora ivyo uwantumye ashaka.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" /><char style="wj">Kandi ivyo uwantumye ashaka ni ibi: ko ntatakaza n’umwe mu bo yampaye, ariko ashaka ko nzobazura ku musi wa nyuma.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" /><char style="wj">Kuko ico Data ashaka ni uko uwubonye Umwana akamwizera agira ubugingo budashira, kandi nanje nzomuzura ku musi wa nyuma.”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Maze Abayuda batangura kumwidogera kuko avuze ati: <char style="wj">“Ni jewe mukate wamanutse uva mw’ijuru.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Baravuga bati: “Mbega uwu si Yesu mwene Yosefu? Se na nyina ntitubazi? None ni gute avuga ngo: <char style="wj">‘Namanutse mva mw’ijuru’</char>?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Nimureke kwidoga hagati muri mwebwe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" /><char style="wj">Nta muntu n’umwe ashobora kuza aho ndi Data yantumye atamuzanye, kandi nzomuzura ku musi wa nyuma.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" /><char style="wj">Abavugishwa n’Imana banditse bati: ‘Bose bazokwigishwa n’Imana.’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Yesaya 54:13</ref></char></char></note> <char style="wj">Ni co gituma umuntu wese yumvirije Data akakira inyigisho ziwe, aza aho ndi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" /><char style="wj">Ivyo ntibisigura ko hari umuntu amaze kubona Data; uwatumwe avuye ku Mana wenyene ni we amaze kubona Data.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" /><char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, uwizera afise ubugingo budashira.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" /><char style="wj">Ni jewe mukate w’ubugingo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" /><char style="wj">Ba sogokuruza banyu baririye manu mu bugaragwa, yamara barapfuye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" /><char style="wj">Ariko hano hari umukate uva mw’ijuru, kandi uwuwurya ntazopfa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" /><char style="wj">Ni jewe mukate w’ubugingo wamanutse uva mw’ijuru. Umuntu wese arya uwo mukate azobaho ibihe bidashira. Uwo mukate ni umubiri wanje nzotanga kugira ngo isi igire ubugingo.”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Maze Abayuda batangura guharira hagati yabo bashavuye bati: “Ni gute uwu mugabo yoduha umubiri wiwe ngo tuwurye?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ndababwire ukuri, nimutarya umubiri w’Umwana w’Umuntu ngo munywe n’amaraso yiwe, nta bugingo muzogira muri mwebwe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" /><char style="wj">Ariko umuntu wese arya umubiri wanje akanywa n’amaraso yanje afise ubugingo budashira, kandi nzomuzura ku musi wa nyuma.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" /><char style="wj">Kuko umubiri wanje ni ico co kurya c’ukuri n’amaraso yanje ni ico cokunywa c’ukuri.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" /><char style="wj">Umuntu wese arya umubiri wanje akanywa n’amaraso yanje aguma muri jewe nanje nkaguma muri we.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" /><char style="wj">Data yantumye ni muzima kandi ndiho ku bwiwe; ni ko n’uwundya na we azobaho ku bwanje.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" /><char style="wj">Uwu ni wo mukate wamanutse uva mw’ijuru; ntusa na ya manu ba sogokuruza banyu baririye mu bugaragwa ariko bagapfa. Uwurya uwu mukate azobaho ibihe bidashira.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yesu yavuze ivyo ariko arigishiriza mw’isinagogi i Kaperinawumu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abigishwa benshi baheba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Benshi bo mu bigishwa biwe bavyumvise baravuga bati: “Izi nyigisho ziragumye. Ni nde yozemera?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yesu amenye ko abigishwa biwe bariko baridoga, arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega ivyo ndababwiye birabatsitaje?</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" /><char style="wj">None hamwe mwobona Umwana w’Umuntu aduga asubira iyo yaje ava, mwovuga iki?</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" /><char style="wj">Mpwemu w’Imana ni we atanga ubugingo, umuntu nta co yokwishoboza. Amajambo nababwiye arimwo impwemu kandi ni ubugingo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" /><char style="wj">Ariko bamwe muri mwebwe ntibizera.”</char> Kuko kuva mu ntago, Yesu yari azi abatizera n’uwuzomugurisha. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Yongerako ati: <char style="wj">“Ni co gituma nababwiye ko ata muntu ashobora kuza aho ndi atabishobojwe na Data.”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Kuva ico gihe benshi mu bigishwa biwe baca baragenda ntibasubira kumukurikira.<verse eid="JHN 6:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Yesu ahindukirira bamwe cumi na babiri arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega namwe murashaka kwigira?”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simoni Petero aramwishura ati: “Mwami, twokuvako tugakurikira nde? Erega ni wewe ufise amajambo atanga ubugingo budashira! <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Twebwe twarakwizeye turatahura ko uri Uwera w’Imana.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesu aca arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Sinabatoranije muri cumi na babiri? Ariko umwe muri mwebwe ni uwa Satani.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />(Aho yariko avuga Yuda, mwene Simoni Isikariyote. Kuko naho yari umwe muri bamwe cumi na babiri, ni we yari agiye kumugurisha.)<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aja ku musi mukuru yinyegeje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Inyuma y’ivyo, Yesu agendagenda mu ntara ya Galilaya. Ntiyashaka kugenda mu ntara ya Yudaya kuko abakuru b’Abayuda baho bariko barondera ingene bomwica. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Ico gihe, umusi mukuru w’insago Abayuda bahimbaza wari wegereje. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Nuko bene nyina ba Yesu baramubwira bati: “Va mu ntara ya Galilaya uje mu ntara ya Yudaya kugira ngo abigishwa bawe babayo babone ibikorwa ukora. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Nta muntu arondera kumenyekana hanyuma ngo akore yinyegeje. Ko uriko urakora ibikorwa nk’ibi, niwiyereke isi!” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Mu bisanzwe, na bene nyina na bo ntibamwizera.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Igihe canje ntikirashika. Kuri mwebwe igihe cose ni ciza.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" /><char style="wj">Isi ntishobora kubanka, ariko jewe iranyanka kuko ndayagiriza ibikorwa bibi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" /><char style="wj">Mwebwe nimugende ku musi mukuru. Jewe sinjayo kuko igihe canje kitarashika.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Ahejeje kubabwira ivyo, aca aguma mu ntara ya Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Ariko bene nyina bamaze kugenda ku musi mukuru, Yesu na we aragenda ariko ntiyajayo ku mugaragaro, agenda yinyegeje. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Kuri uwo musi mukuru, abakuru b’Abayuda bariko bararondera Yesu, babazanya bati: “Ari he?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Kandi mw’isinzi ry’abantu bari ngaho, hari urusaku rwinshi bavugana ku vya Yesu. Bamwe bavuga bati: “Ni umuntu mwiza.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:12">Abandi bakavuga bati: “Oya, ni umuntu azimiza abantu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Ariko nta n’umwe yubahuka kuvuga ivyiwe ku mugaragaro kuko batinya Abayuda.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yigisha ku musi mukuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Umusi mukuru ugeze hagati, Yesu yinjira mu rusengero atangura kwigisha. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Abayuda bamwumvise baratangara, barabazanya bati: “Uwo mugabo azi vyinshi cane kandi atize. Ivyo bishoboka gute?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Inyigisho ntanga si izanje, ziva ku wantumye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" /><char style="wj">Umuntu wese ahisemwo gukora ivyo Imana ishaka azotahura nimba inyigisho zanje ziva ku Mana canke ko ari amajambo yanje gusa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" /><char style="wj">Uwuvuga amajambo yiwe ubwiwe, aba arondera icubahiro ciwe, ariko uwurondera icubahiro c’uwamutumye avuga ukuri, nta binyoma biri muri we.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" /><char style="wj">Mbega Mose ntiyabahaye Ivyagezwe? Ariko nta n’umwe muri mwebwe avyubahiriza. Ni kuki mushaka kunyica?”</char><verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Abantu benshi baravuga bati: “Wewe uboshwe na dayimoni. Ni nde ashaka kukwica?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nakoze igitangaza kimwe ku musi w’Isabato mwese muratangara.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" /><char style="wj">Ariko namwe iyo mwubahiriza icagezwe ca Mose co gukeba abana b’abahungu ku musi w’Isabato, ico na co ni igikorwa. (Ariko ico cagezwe nticazanywe na Mose, catanguriye kuri ba sogokuruza.)</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" /><char style="wj">Nimba mushobora gukeba umwana w’umuhungu ku musi w’Isabato kugira ngo mwubahirize icagezwe ca Mose, ni kuki munshavurira iyo nkijije umuntu ku musi w’Isabato.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" /><char style="wj">Nimureke guca imanza mufatiye ku vyo mubona gusa, nimuce imanza zigororotse.”</char><verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoba ari Kristo?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Ico gihe bamwe mu bantu baba i Yerusalemu batangura kubazanya bati: “Mbega uwu si wa muntu bashaka kwica? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Raba, ariko aravuga ku mugaragaro, kandi nta co bamugize. None abakuru boba bemeye vy’ukuri ko ari we Kristo? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Ariko turazi iyo uwu mugabo ava; Kristo ni yaza, nta muntu n’umwe azomenya iyo aje ava.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Yesu akiriko arigisha mu rusengero arasemerera ati: <char style="wj">“Ni vyo muranzi, kandi murazi aho mva. Yamara sinaje mu bushobozi bwanje. Uwantumye ni umunyakuri, kandi ntimumuzi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" /><char style="wj">Ariko jewe ndamuzi kuko mva iwe kandi ni we yantumye.”</char><verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Maze abantu baca bagerageza kumufata ariko nta n’umwe yashoboye kumukozako iminwe kuko igihe ciwe kitari bwashike. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Ariko benshi mu bari aho baramwizeye, bavuga bati: “None Kristo niyaza azokora ibitangaza birenze ivyo uwu ariko arakora?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Abafarisayo bumvise ivyo abantu bariko barongoreranira kuri Yesu, baca bafatanya n’abaherezi bakurubakuru batuma abarinzi b’urusengero gufata Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yesu aravuga ati: <char style="wj">“Ndi kumwe namwe igihe gito gusa, hanyuma nzoca nsubira ku wantumye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" /><char style="wj">Muzondondera ariko ntimuzombona; kandi ntimushobora gushika aho ngiye.”</char><verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Abayuda baravugana bati: “Mbega uwu mugabo afise umugambi wo kuja he, aho tudashobora kumubona? Yoba ashaka kuja mu Bayuda baba mu Bagiriki? Yoba ashaka kuja kwigisha Abagiriki? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Yashatse kuvuga iki aho yavuga ngo: <char style="wj">‘Muzondondera ariko ntimuzombona,’</char> canke ngo: <char style="wj">‘aho ngiye ntimushobora kuhashika’</char>?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Ku musi wa nyuma w’iyo misi mikuru, ari wo uruta iyindi, Yesu arahaguruka avuga n’ijwi rirenga ati: <char style="wj">“Uwunyotewe wese naze aho ndi anywe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" /><char style="wj">Uwunyizera wese, inzuzi z’amazi y’ubugingo zizotemba ziva mu mutima wiwe, nk’uko Ivyanditswe bivuga.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Aho Yesu yashaka kuvuga kuri Mpwemu Yera, uwo abamwizera bari bagiye guhabwa. Gushika ico gihe Mpwemu Yera ntiyari bwatangwe, kuko Yesu atari bwashike mu bwiza bwiwe.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Bumvise ayo majambo, bamwe mu bantu bari aho baravuga bati: “Ni ivy’ukuri uwu muntu ni uwuvugishwa n’Imana!”<verse eid="JHN 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Abandi bavuga bati: “Ni Kristo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Abandi na bo bati: “Kristo ntashobora kuva i Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Mbega Ivyanditswe ntibivuga ko Kristo azova mu ruvyaro rwa Dawidi i Betelehemu, igisagara Dawidi yabayemwo?” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Maze bituma abantu batumvikana kubera Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Bamwe muri bo bashaka kumufata, ariko nta n’umwe yubahutse kumukozako ukuboko.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukutizera kw’abakuru b’Abayuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Hanyuma abarinzi b’urusengero bagarutse aho abaherezi bakurubakuru n’Abafarisayo bari batazanye Yesu, barababaza bati: “Ni kuki mutamuzanye?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Ba barinzi barabishura bati: “Nta muntu yigeze kuvuga nk’uko uwu mugabo avuga!”<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Abafarisayo barababaza bati: “Mushaka kuvuga ko namwe yabazimije? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Nta n’umwe muri twebwe abakuru canke Abafarisayo yamwizeye. <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Abamwizeye ni iryo sinzi ry’abantu batazi ivyagezwe, kandi abo bariko umuvumo!”<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Umufarisayo yitwa Nikodemu, umwe yaja kuraba Yesu mw’ijoro, arababaza ati: <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Mbega ivyagezwe vyacu biratwemerera gucira urubanza umuntu tutabanje kumwumviriza ngo tumenye ivyo yakoze?”<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Na bo baramwishura bati: “Mbega nawe uva i Galilaya? Urasoma neza Ivyanditswe uzobona ko ata wuvugishwa n’Imana ava i Galilaya!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu nzandiko zimwezimwe za Bibiliya amajambo yo muri <char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 7:53-8:11">Yohana 7:53–8:11</ref></char> ntirimwo.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:52">[ <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Nuko inama ica irahera, bose barataha.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Nuko Yesu aduga ku Musozi wa Elayono.<verse eid="JHN 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Kare mu gitondo c’umusi ukurikira asubira mu rusengero, maze abantu bakoranira aho ari, na we aricara arabigisha. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Abigisha b’ivyagezwe n’Abafarisayo bazana umugore bafashe ariko arasambana, bamuhagarika imbere y’abari ngaho bose. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Babaza Yesu bati: “Mwigisha, uwu mugore yafashwe ariko arasambana. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Ivyagezwe vya Mose bivuga ko umugore nk’uwu akwiye kwicishwa amabuye. None ubivugako iki?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Babajije Yesu ico kibazo kugira ngo bamutege umutego, maze baronke aho bahera mu kumwagiriza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:6">Ariko Yesu arunama atangura kwandikisha urutoke hasi. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Ba bigisha b’ivyagezwe n’Abafarisayo babandanije bamubaza, aca urunamuka arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Umuntu atagira icaha muri mwebwe nabe ari we aba uwa mbere mu kumutera ibuye.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Aca asubira kwunama abandanya yandika hasi.<verse eid="JHN 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Bavyumvise, baca batangura gusohoka umwumwe uhereye ku bakuze, kugeza aho Yesu asigarana na wa mugore ahagaze imbere yiwe. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yesu arunamuka aramubaza ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega abariko barakwagiriza bagiye he? Nta n’umwe yaguciriye urubanza?”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Na we aramwishura ati: “Oya, nyakwubahwa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Yesu aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nanje nta rubanza ndagucira. Niwigire ariko ntugasubire gukora icaha.”</char>]<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ni umuco w’isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Nuko Yesu abandanya yigisha ba bantu, ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Jewe ndi umuco w’isi. Uwunkurikira ntazogendera mu mwijima, ahubwo azoronka umuco w’ubugingo.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Abafarisayo baramubwira bati: “Noneho wishingiye intahe! Intahe nk’iyo si iy’ukuri.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Naho nishingiye intahe, intahe yanje ni iy’ukuri, kuko ndazi iyo naje mva n’iyo ndiko ndaja. Ariko mwebwe ntimuzi iyo naje mva n’iyo ndiko ndaja.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" /><char style="wj">Mwebwe muca imanza nk’abantu, ariko jewe nta n’umwe ncira urubanza.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" /><char style="wj">Iyo ndamutse nca urubanza, ruba ari urw’ukuri, kuko simba ndi jenyene, mba ndi kumwe na Data yantumye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" /><char style="wj">Mu Vyagezwe vyanyu handitswemwo ko intahe y’ivyabona bibiri iba ari iy’ukuri.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" /><char style="wj">Jewe ndishingira intahe, kandi na Data yantumye arayinshingira.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Na bo baramubaza bati: “Mbega So ari he?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ntimunzi kandi na Data ntimumuzi. Kuko iyo mumenya uwo ndi we, na Data mwari kumumenya.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesu yavuze ayo majambo ariko yigishiriza mu rusengero, ahagaze hafi y’ico batorezamwo amashikanwa. Ariko nta n’umwe yamufashe kuko igihe ciwe kitari bwashike.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babaza Yesu uwo ari we</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yesu yongera kubabwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ngiye kugenda, kandi muzondondera, ariko muzopfira mu vyaha vyanyu. Aho ngiye kuja, ntimushobora kuhashika.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Ivyo vyatumye Abayuda bibaza bati: “None agiye kwiyahura? Ni kuki avuze ngo: <char style="wj">‘Aho ngiye kuja, ntimushobora gushikayo’</char>?”<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yesu arabandanya ati: <char style="wj">“Mwebwe muri abo kuri iyi si, ariko jewe nkomoka hejuru. Muri ab’ino si, ariko jewe sindi uw’ino si.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" /><char style="wj">Ni co gituma nababwiye ko muzopfira mu vyaha vyanyu; kuko nimutizera ko ndi uwo nababwiye ko ndi, muzopfira mu vyaha vyanyu.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Baramubaza bati: “None uri nde?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ndi urya namye ndababwira ko ndi kuva mu ntango.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" /><char style="wj">Mfise vyinshi nobavugako kandi mfise vyinshi vyobatsindisha. Ariko mbwira ab’isi ivyo numvise uwantumye avuga gusa, kandi avuga ukuri.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Ariko ntibashobora gutahura ko ariko avuga Se. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Nuko Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nimwamara kumanika Umwana w’Umuntu ku musaraba ni ho muzomenya ko ndi uwo ndiko ndababwira, kandi ko ata co nkora nigeneye, ahubwo ko mvuga ivyo Data yanyigishije.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" /><char style="wj">Uwantumye ari kumwe nanje; ntiyandetse jenyene, kuko nama nkora ibimunezereza.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Maze benshi mu bamwumvise avuga ayo majambo baramwizera.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukuri kuzobaha kwidegemvya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Nuko Yesu abwira Abayuda bari bamwizeye ati: <char style="wj">“Ikizokwerekana ko muri abigishwa banje vy’ukuri ni ugushira mu ngiro inyigisho zanje.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" /><char style="wj">Muzomenya ukuri, na kwo kuzobaha ukwidegemvya.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Na bo baramwishura bati: “Twebwe turi uruvyaro rwa Aburahamu, ntitwigeze tuba abagurano b’umuntu n’umwe. Ni gute utubwira ngo tuzoronka ukwidegemvya!”<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ndababwire ukuri, umuntu wese akora icaha ni umugurano waco.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" /><char style="wj">Kandi umugurano ntafise ikibanza gihoraho mu muryango, ariko umwana yama ari uwo mu muryago wiwe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" /><char style="wj">None rero, Umwana niyabagira abidegemvya, muzoba abidegemvya vy’ukuri.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" /><char style="wj">Ndazi ko muri uruvyaro rwa Aburahamu. Ariko muriko murondera ingene mwonyica kuko ijambo ryanje ritagira ikibanza mu mitima yanyu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" /><char style="wj">Ndiko ndababwira ivyo nabonanye Data, ariko mwebwe mukurikiza ivyo mwigishijwe na so.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Baramwishura bati: “Data ni Aburahamu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Iyo muba muri abana ba Aburahamu, mwari gukora ivyo Aburahamu yakora.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" /><char style="wj">Raba ndababwiye ukuri nigishijwe n’Imana, none mushaka kunyica. Aburahamu ntiyigeze akora ibisa n’ivyo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" /><char style="wj">Mwebwe mukora nk’ivyo so akora.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Na bo baramwishura bati: “Twebwe ntituri abana b’ibivyarwa. Imana ubwayo ni yo Data.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Iyo Imana ija kuba ari yo So, mwari kunkunda, kuko naje hano ntumwe na yo. Sinaje nirungitse, ni Imana yantumye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" /><char style="wj">Ni kuki mudatahura inyigisho zanje? Ni kubera mudashobora no kwumviriza amajambo yanje.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" /><char style="wj">Muri abana ba so, Satani, kandi mugomba gushitsa ibikorwa bibi so ashaka. Yamye ari umwicanyi kuva mu ntango. Yamye yanka ukuri, kuko ata kuri kuri muri we. Iyo avuga ibinyoma, aba ariko avuga ururimi kavukire, kuko ni umubeshi kandi ni se w’ibinyoma.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" /><char style="wj">Ni co gituma iyo ndababwiye ukuri, ntimushobora kunyizera.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" /><char style="wj">Hari n’umwe muri mwebwe ashobora kunyagiriza icaha? None nimba ndababwira ukuri, ni kuki mutanyizera?</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" /><char style="wj">Uwuva ku Mana wese yakira amajambo y’Imana. Mwebwe ntimuyakira kuko mutari ab’Imana.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu avuga uwo ari we</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Abayuda baramwishura bati: “Ntitwihenze aho twavuga ko uri Umusamariya kandi ko uboshwe n’umudayimoni!”<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Jewe simboshwe n’umudayimoni; nubaha Data ariko mwebwe ntimunyubaha.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" /><char style="wj">Jewe sinironderera icubahiro; ariko hariho uwukindonderera kandi ni we mucamanza.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" /><char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, umuntu wese yumvira amajambo yanje ntazokwigera apfa.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Abayuda bumvise ayo majambo baramubwira bati: “Ubu rero turatahuye neza ko uboshwe n’umudayimoni! Yaba Aburahamu canke abavugishwa n’Imana barapfuye, none wewe uvuze ngo: <char style="wj">‘Umuntu wese yumvira amajambo yawe ntazokwigera apfa!’</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Mbega uruta sogokuruza Aburahamu, ko we n’abavugishwa n’Imana bapfuye? Wewe wigira iki?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Nimba niha icubahiro, icubahiro canje nta co kimaze. Data, uwo muvuga ko ari Imana yanyu, ni we ampa icubahiro.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" /><char style="wj">Naho mutamuzi, jewe ndamuzi. Iyo mvuga ko ntamuzi, nari kuba mbaye umubeshi nkamwe, ariko ndamuzi kandi ndumvira ijambo ryiwe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" /><char style="wj">Sokuruza wanyu Aburahamu yari yiteganye umunezero umusi wo kuza kwanje; yarawubonye kandi yaranezerewe.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Abayuda baramubaza bati: “Nta n’imyaka mirongo itanu uramara none uvuze ngo warabonye Aburahamu?”<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ndababwire ukuri, Aburahamu ataravuka, jewe nariho!”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Bumvise ayo majambo baca batora amabuye ngo bayamutere, ariko Yesu aca arinyegeza, arasohoka ava mu rusengero.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu akiza umuntu yavutse ari impumyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Yesu ariko ararengana, abona umuntu yavutse ari impumyi. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Abigishwa biwe baramubaza bati: “Mwigisha, ni nde yacumuye bigatuma uwu muntu avuka ari impumyi: mbega ni we canke ni abavyeyi biwe?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ntivyavuye ku vyaha vyiwe canke ku vy’abavyeyi biwe, ariko ibi vyabaye kugira ngo ubushobozi bw’Imana bwiyerekanire muri we.</char> <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" /><char style="wj">Dutegerezwa gukora ibikorwa vy’uwantumye hakibona. Ijoro riraje, aho ata wushobora gukora.</char> <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" /><char style="wj">Nkiri mw’isi, ndi umuco w’isi.”</char><verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Ahejeje kuvuga ayo majambo, acira amate hasi, avuruga utwondo akoresheje ayo mate; adusiga ku maso ya wa muntu. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Genda wiyuhagire ku kidengeri c’i Silowamu”</char> (Silowamu bisigura Uwatumwe). Wa muntu aragenda ariyuhagira, agaruka abona.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Ababanyi biwe n’abari bamuzi ari impumyi isegerereza barabazanya bati: “Mbega uwu si wa muntu yahora yicara asegerereza?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Bamwe baravuga bati: “Ni we.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Ariko abandi bakavuga bati: “Oya, ni uwo basa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Ariko wa muntu arababwira ati: “Ni jewe!”<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Baramubaza bati: “None vyagenze gute ngo amaso yawe ahumuke?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Arabishura ati: “Umuntu bita Yesu ni we yavuruze utwondo atunsiga ku maso, hanyuma ambwira ati: <char style="wj">‘Genda wiyuhagire ku kidengeri c’i Silowamu.’</char> Naciye njayo ndiyuhagira, none ndabona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Baramubaza bati: “None uwo muntu ari he?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Arababwira ati: “Sindahazi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abafarisayo batohoza ivy’ukwo gukira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Nuko bajana wa muntu yahoze ari impunyi imbere y’Abafarisayo, <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />kuko Yesu yari yavuruze utwondo, agakiza iyo mpumyi ku musi w’Isabato. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Abafarisayo na bo babaza wa muntu ingene yahumutse, na we abishura ati: “Yansize utwondo ku maso, nca ndiyuhagira, none ndabona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Bamwe mu Bafarisayo baravuga bati: “Uwu muntu yakoze ibi ntava ku Mana, kuko ntiyubahiriza umusi w’Isabato.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Ariko abandi barabaza bati: “None umunyavyaha yoshobora gukora ibitangaza nk’ibi?” Maze ivyo bituma bacanamwo.<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Nuko basubira kubaza umwe yahoze ari impumyi bati: “None wewe wibaza iki kuri uwo muntu yagukijije ubuhumyi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Wa muntu arabishura ati: “Ni uwuvugishwa n’Imana.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Abakuru b’Abayuda baranse kwemera ko yahora ari impumyi ariko akaba yakize, kugeza batumyeko abavyeyi biwe. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Bashitse, barababaza bati: “Uwu yoba ari umuhungu wanyu? Yoba yavutse ari impumyi? None habaye iki ko abona?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Abavyeyi biwe barabishura bati: “Ico tuzi, ni umwana wacu kandi yavutse ari impunyi. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Ariko ntituzi uko vyagenze ngo ahumuke kandi ntituzi uwamukijije. Nimumwibarize arakuze, arashobora kwivugira.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Abavyeyi biwe bishuye uko kuko batinya abakuru b’Abayuda. Abo bakuru bari bafashe ingingo ko umuntu wese azovuga ko Yesu ari Kristo azokwirukanwa mu rusengero. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Ni co gituma bavuze bati: “Nimumwibarize, arakuze.”<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Basubira gutumako wa muntu yahora ari impumyi ubugira kabiri, baramubwira bati: “Ubaha Imana, utubwire ukuri, kuko turazi ko urya muntu yagukijije ari umunyavyaha.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Arabishura ati: “Aba umunyavyaha, ataba we, ivyo nta co ndabiziko. Ico nzi ni uko nahora ndi impumyi ariko ubu nkaba mbona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Baramubaza bati: “None yakoze iki? Yaguhumuye gute?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Arabishura ati: “Ivyo namaze kubibabwira ariko ntimwashatse kuvyumva. Ni kuki mushaka kuvyumva kandi? Mwoba mushaka kuba abigishwa biwe namwe?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Baca baramutuka, bamubwira bati: “Ni wewe uri umwigishwa wiwe, twebwe turi abigishwa ba Mose! <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Turazi ko Imana yavuganye na Mose, ariko ntituzi iyo uwo muntu yaje ava.”<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Wa muntu yahoze ari impumyi arabishura ati: “Ivyo biratangaje cane! Ntimuzi iyo yaje ava, kandi yampumuye? <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Turazi ko Imana itumva ugusenga kw’abanyavyaha, ariko ko yumva ugusenga kw’umuntu ayubaha agakora ivyo ishaka. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Nta muntu n’umwe yari bwumve aho umuntu yakijije uwavutse ari impumyi. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Iyo uwo muntu ataba yaje ava ku Mana, nta co yari gushobora gukora.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Baramwishura bati: “Wewe wavukiye mu vyaha wongera ubikuriramwo, none uriko uratwigisha!” Nuko baca baramwirukana mu rusengero.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubuhumyi bwo mu buryo bw’impwemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yesu yumvise ko bamwirukanye mu rusengero, aja kumurondera, aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega urizera Umwana w’Umuntu?”</char><verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Wa muntu aramubaza ati: “Yoba ari nde ga nyakwubahwa, kugira ngo ndamwizere?”<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Wamaze kumubona kuko ni we muriko muravugana.”</char><verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Wa muntu aravuga ati: “Mwami, ndizeye.” Nuko aca aramwunamira.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yesu aca avuga ati: <char style="wj">“Naje muri iyi si guca urubanza, kugira ngo abahumye bahumuke, maze abibaza ko babona na bo ndabereke ko ari impumyi.”</char><verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Bamwe mu Bafarisayo bari kumwe na we, bumvise ayo majambo, baramubaza bati: “Ushaka kuvuga ko natwe turi impumyi?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Iyo muba impumyi, ntimwokwagiriwe n’icaha, ariko ko mwemeza ko mubona, icaha canyu kigumaho.</char>”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ni Umwungere mwiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />“<char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, umuntu wese yinjira adaciye mu muryango w’uruhongore rw’intama, ariko akuririra ahandi, uwo ni igisuma kandi ni umwambuzi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" /><char style="wj">Uwinjira aciye mw’irembo ni we mwungere w’intama.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" /><char style="wj">Umurinzi w’irembo aramwugururira, kandi intama zirumva ijwi ryiwe. Ahamagara intama ziwe mu mazina yazo, akaziturutsa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" /><char style="wj">Amaze kuzisohora zose, azija imbere, na zo zikamukurikira kuko zizi ijwi ryiwe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" /><char style="wj">Ntizishobora gukurikira uwo zitazi, ahubwo ziramuhunga kuko zitazi ijwi ryiwe.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Ivyo Yesu yabibabwiye mu mugani, kandi abamwumviriza ntibashoboye gutahura ico ashatse kuvuga.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Nuko Yesu yongera kubabwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ndababwire ukuri, ni jewe rembo ry’intama.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" /><char style="wj">Abanyitangiye imbere bose bari ibisuma n’abambuzi, ariko intama ntizabumvirije.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" /><char style="wj">Ni jewe rembo; umuntu wese yinjiye aciye muri jewe azokizwa. Azokwinjira, asohoke kandi aronke ikimutunga.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" /><char style="wj">Igisuma ntikizanwa n’ikindi atari ukwiba, ukwica no gutikiza; ariko jewe naje kugira ngo intama zigire ubugingo, kandi zibugire busagutse.</char><verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />
    <char style="wj">Jewe ndi umwungere mwiza. Umwungere mwiza yitangira intama ziwe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" /><char style="wj">Umucangero arahunga iyo abonye ibingira rije. Arata intama agahunga kuko atari umwungere wazo kandi intama zitari iziwe, maze rya bingira rikitera mu ntama rikazishwiragiza.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" /><char style="wj">Umucangero arahunga kuko akorera amahera kandi atababaye intama.</char><verse eid="JHN 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />
    <char style="wj">Jewe ndi umwungere mwiza; ndazi intama zanje kandi na zo ziranzi,</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" /><char style="wj">nk’uko Data anzi nanje nkamumenya. Ni co gituma ntanga ubugingo bwanje ku bwazo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" /><char style="wj">Ndafise n’izindi ntama zitari muri uru ruhongore. Na zo ntegerezwa kuzizana. Zizokwumva ijwi ryanje, maze habe umukuku umwe n’umwungere umwe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" /><char style="wj">Igituma Data ankunda ni uko ntanga ubuzima bwanje kugira ngo nzosubire kubwakira.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" /><char style="wj">Nta muntu n’umwe ashobora kubunyaka, ndabutanga ari uko ndabishatse. Mfise ubushobozi bwo kubutanga n’ubwo kubwakira gushasha. Iki ni co Data yantegetse gukora.”</char><verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Abayuda bumvise ayo majambo, baca basubira gucanamwo. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Benshi muri bo bavuga bati: “Aboshwe n’umudayimoni kandi arasara. Ni kuki mumwumviriza?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Ariko abandi bavuga bati: “Aya majambo si ay’umuntu aboshwe n’umudayimoni. Mbega umudayimoni yohumura amaso y’impumyi?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abayuda banka kwizera Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Ico gihe i Yerusalemu hariko habera imisi mikuru yo kwibuka ishikirizwa ry’urusengero, kandi hari mu gihe c’imbeho nyinshi cane. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yesu ariko aragendagenda mu rusengero mw’ibaraza rya Salomo, <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Abayuda bari aho baramukikuza, bamubaza bati: “Uzodutomorera ryari? Nimba uri Kristo, bitubwire neza.”<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Narabibabwiye ariko ntimwanyizeye. Ikibishingira intahe ni ibikorwa nkora mw’izina rya Data,</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" /><char style="wj">ariko ntimwizera kuko mutari abo mu ntama zanje.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" /><char style="wj">Intama zanje zumva ijwi ryanje; ndazizi na zo zirankurikira.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" /><char style="wj">Nanje ndaziha ubugingo budashira, kandi ntizizokwigera zipfa rubi. Nta n’umwe ashobora kuzinkura mu kuboko.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" /><char style="wj">Data yazimpaye aruta bose; nta muntu n’umwe ashobora kuzikura mu kuboko kwa Data.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" /><char style="wj">Kandi twe na Data turi umwe.”</char><verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Nuko Abayuda bongera gutora amabuye ngo bayamutere, <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />ariko Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ko nakoreye imbere yanyu ibikorwa vyiza vyinshi ndabitumwe na Data, none ni ikihe muri ivyo gitumye mugomba kuntera amabuye?”</char><verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Baramwishura bati: “Ntitugomba kugutera amabuye kubera igikorwa ciza, ahubwo tuguhora gutuka Imana; kuko uri umuntu asanzwe, ariko ukigira Imana!”<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega mu Vyagezwe vyanyu, ntihanditswe ko Imana yavuze iti: ‘Navuze ko muri imana’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 82:6">Zaburi 82:6</ref></char></char></note><char style="wj">?</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" /><char style="wj">Murazi ko ata gishobora guhindura Ivyanditswe. None nimba ababwiwe iryo jambo biswe ‘imana,’</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" /><char style="wj">none vyocura iki ku wo Data yatoranije nk’uwiwe bwite hanyuma akamurungika kw’isi? Ni kuki munyagiriza ko ntutse Imana, mvuze nti: ‘Ndi Umwana w’Imana’?</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" /><char style="wj">Nimba ntakora ibikorwa vya Data, ntimunyizere!</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" /><char style="wj">Ariko nimba nkora ibikorwa vya Data, naho mutonyizera jewe, nimwizere ibikorwa nkora, kugira ngo mumenye kandi mutahure ko Data ari muri jewe nanje nkaba muri we.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Nuko bagerageza kumufata kandi, ariko arabacika.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Yesu aca asubira hakurya ya Yorodani mu kibanza Yohana yabatirizamwo mu misi ya mbere, ahamara igihe. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Abantu benshi baza aho ari, baravuga bati: “Naho Yohana ata gitangaza yakoze, ivyo yavuze vyose kuri uwu muntu vyose ni ukuri.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Maze benshi mu bari ngaho bizera Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Urupfu rwa Lazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Hariho umuntu yitwa Lazaro yava i Betaniya yari agwaye. Betaniya cari igisagara Mariya na Marita mwene nyina babamwo. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />(Uwo Mariya ni umwe yasuka amavuta atamirana ku birenge vy’Umwami Yesu akabihanaguza imishatsi yiwe. Musazawe, Lazaro, ni we yari agwaye.) <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Nuko bashiki ba Lazaro batumako Yesu bati: “Mwami, umwe ukunda aragwaye.”<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Yesu avyumvise, aravuga ati: <char style="wj">“Ingwara ya Lazaro si iyo kumwica. Ahubwo ni iyo kwerekana icubahiro c’Imana, kugira ngo Umwana w’Imana ahabwe icubahiro biciye muri yo.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yesu yarakunda Marita na mwene nyina Mariya na Lazaro. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Ariko inyuma yo kwumva ko Lazaro agwaye, yamaze aho yari ari iyindi misi ibiri. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Hanyuma abwira abigishwa biwe ati: <char style="wj">“Ingo dusubire i Yudaya.”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Abigishwa biwe baramubaza bati: “Mwigisha, haheze imisi mike cane Abayuda bashatse kugutera amabuye, none ushaka gusubirayo?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega umurango ntugizwe n’amasaha cumi n’abiri? Uwugenda ku murango ntashobora gutsitara, kuko abonesherezwa n’umuco w’iyi si.</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" /><char style="wj">Ariko iyo umuntu agenda mw’ijoro arashobora gutsitara kuko ata muco uba uhari.”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Ahejeje kuvuga ivyo, arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Umukunzi wacu Lazaro arasinziriye; ariko ngira nje kumuvyura.”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Abigishwa baramwishura bati: “Mwami nimba asinziriye, azokira.” <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Yesu yashaka kuvuga ko Lazaro yapfuye, ariko bo bibaza ko ari ugusinzira gusanzwe.<verse eid="JHN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Nuko aca arabitomora ati: <char style="wj">“Lazaro yapfuye,</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" /><char style="wj">kandi ndanezerewe ku bwanyu kubona atari yo nari ndi, kuko muraja kunyizera. Nimuze tuje kumuraba.”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Toma (uwari azwi ko ari Ihasa) abwira abigishwa bagenziwe ati: “Reka tugende natwe dupfane na Yesu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ni ukuzuka n’ubugingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Yesu ashitse i Betaniya, asanga Lazaro amaze imisi ine ari mu mva. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Betaniya hari hafi y’i Yerusalemu, nko kuri sitadiyo cumi na zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilometero 3</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Abayuda benshi bari baje kwa Marita na Mariya kubaremesha inyuma y’urupfu rwa musaza wabo. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Marita yumvise ko Yesu aje, arasohoka aja kumusanganira, ariko Mariya aguma i muhira.<verse eid="JHN 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Maze Marita abwira Yesu ati: “Mwami, iyo uja kuba hano, musazanje ntaba yarapfuye. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Ariko n’ubu ndazi ko ico usaba Imana cose ikiguha.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Musazawe ategerezwa kuzuka.”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Marita aramwishura ati: “Ndazi ko azozuka ku musi wa nyuma.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ni jewe kuzuka n’ubugingo. Uwunyizera wese, naho yopfa, azobaho.</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" /><char style="wj">Umuntu wese aba muri jewe kandi akanyizera ntazokwigera apfa. Ivyo uravyizera ga Marita?”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Marita aramwishura ati: “Egome Mwami, ndizera ko uri Kristo, Umwana w’Imana, umwe ategerezwa kuza mw’isi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Ahejeje kuvuga ayo majambo, aca aja guhamagara mwene nyina Mariya aramwihererana, amubwira ati: “Umwigisha ari hano kandi arashaka kukubona.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Mariya avyumvise aca arahaguruka ubwo nyene aja iyo Yesu ari. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Yesu ntiyari bwinjire mu mihana, yari akiri aho bahuriye na Marita. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Abayuda bari kumwe na Mariya mu nzu bamuremesha babonye ahagurutse yihuta agaca asohoka, baramukurikira, kuko bibaza ko yoba agiye ku mva kuririrayo.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Nuko Mariya ashika aho Yesu ari aramubona, aca apfukama imbere yiwe, amubwira ati: “Mwami, iyo uja kuba hano, musazanje ntaba yarapfuye.”<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yesu abonye amarira ya Mariya n’ay’Abayuda bari bazananye na we, afatwa n’ibigumbagumba arababara cane. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Mwamuhamvye he?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">Baramwishura bati: “Mwami ingo wirabire.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesu aca ararira.<verse eid="JHN 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Abayuda bari aho baravuga bati: “Ehe ingene yamukunda!”<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Ariko bamwe baravuga bati: “None ko yakijije ya mpumyi, ntiyari gushobora gukingira Lazaro urupfu?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu azura Lazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Nuko Yesu ashika ku mva akibabaye. Iyo mva yari isenga ryugaje ikibuye kinini. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nimukureho ico kibuye.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Ariko Marita, mushiki w’uwapfuye aramubwira ati: “Mwami, honuka cane kuko amazeyo imisi ine!”<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesu aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Sinakubwiye ko niwizera uja kubona ubwiza bw’Imana?”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Nuko bakuraho ca kibuye. Maze Yesu arangamiza hejuru aca avuga ati: <char style="wj">“Data, ndagushimiye kuko unyumva iyo nsenga.</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" /><char style="wj">Ndazi ko wama unyumva, ariko ibi ndabivuze ku neza y’aba bantu bahagaze hano, kugira ngo bizere ko ari wewe wantumye.”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Ahejeje kuvuga ayo majambo aca arasemerera ati: <char style="wj">“Lazaro, sohoka!”</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Wa muntu yari yarapfuye arasohoka, amaboko n’ibirenge vyiwe bikizingiriyeko impuzu bamuhamvyemwo, mu maso hiwe hazingiriyeko igitambara.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:44">Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nimumubohore, mumureke agende.”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abayuda barondera kwica Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Ivyo vyatumye Abayuda benshi bari baje kugarukira kuri Mariya bizera Yesu, bamaze kubona ivyo akoze. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Ariko bamwe muri bo baciye baja ku Bafarisayo bababwira ivyo Yesu yakoze. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Nuko abaherezi bakurubakuru n’Abafarisayo baca bakoranya inama nkuru y’abatwara ubwoko bw’Abayuda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:47">Barabazanya bati: “Dukore iki? Uwu mugabo ariko akora ibitangaza vyinshi. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Nitwamureka akabandanya uku, abantu bose bazomwizera, maze Abaroma baze bigarurire urusengero rwacu n’igihugu cacu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Nuko umwe muri bo yitwa Kayafa, ari na we yari umuherezi mukuru uwo mwaka, aravuga ati: “Ntimuzi ico muriko muravuga! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Ntimubona ko ari vyiza ko umuntu umwe apfira abantu hako hatikira igihugu cose?”<verse eid="JHN 11:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Ivyo ntiyabivuze avyigeneye; ariko nk’umuherezi mukuru muri uwo mwaka, yaravugishijwe ko Yesu yari agiye gupfira igihugu cose. <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />Kandi si igihugu ca Isirayeli gusa, ahubwo yari agiye gupfira n’abana b’Imana bashwiragiriye mu mahanga, kugira ngo abegeranirize hamwe, abagire umwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Kuva uwo musi baca batangura gutegura ingene bokwica Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 11:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Ivyo vyatumye Yesu adasubira kugendagenda ku mugaragaro mu Bayuda. Ahubwo yaciye aja mu karere ko hafi y’ubugaragwa, mu gisagara gito citwa Efurayimu, agumanayo n’abigishwa biwe.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Imisi mikuru ya Pasika Abayuda bahimbaza yari yegereje, kandi abantu benshi bava mu mihingo yose y’igihugu bakaja i Yerusalemu kugira ngo bagire umugenzo wo kwihumanura imbere y’uko Pasika ishika. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Abantu baguma barondera Yesu mu rusengero, babazanya bati: “Mwibaza ko azoza mu misi mikuru?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Abaherezi bakurubakuru n’Abafarisayo bari batanze itegeko ko umuntu wese yobona aho Yesu ari yoca aja kubibabwira kugira ngo bamufate.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu asukwako amavuta i Betaniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Hagisigaye imisi itandatu ngo Pasika ishike, Yesu aja i Betaniya, aho Lazaro umwe yari yazuye yaba. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Nuko bategurira amazimano Yesu, Marita ni we yazimana, Lazaro na we akaba umwe mu basangira na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Maze Mariya afata icupa ryiza ririmwo amavuta amota cane kandi y’igiciro kinini ahinguwe mu giti bita narada, ayasuka ku birenge vya Yesu, aca abihanaguza umushatsi wiwe. Inzu yose yuzura ugutamirana kw’ayo mavuta.<verse eid="JHN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Ariko umwe mu bigishwa biwe yitwa Yuda Isikariyote, ari we yahavuye amugurisha, aravuga ati: <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Ni kuki aya mavuta atagurishijwe ngo amahera avuyemwo afashe aboro? Igiciro cayo kingana n’idenariyo amajana atatu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ingero umukozi yakorera umwaka wose.</char></note>” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Ivyo ntiyabivuze abitewe no kubabara aboro, ariko yabitewe n’uko yari umusuma. Ni we yari ajejwe ububiko bw’amahera y’abigishwa, kandi kenshi yarayihako akayakoresha ivyiwe.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Yesu arishura ati: <char style="wj">“Nimureke kumugora! Ibi abikoze mu kuntegurira guhambwa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" /><char style="wj">Aboro bo muzokwamana, ariko jewe ntimuzonyamana.”</char><verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Abayuda bamenye ko Yesu ari i Betaniya, baza ari isinzi kumuraba no kuraba Lazaro, umwe yari yazuye mu bapfuye. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Ivyo vyatumye abaherezi bakurubakuru bagira imigambi yo kwica Lazaro na we, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />kuko kubera we, Abayuda benshi bariko barabavako bizera Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yinjira i Yerusalemu nk’Umwami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Ku musi ukurikira, abantu isinzi bari baje mu misi mikuru ya Pasika bumva ko Yesu ari mu nzira aja i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Maze baca amashami y’ibigazi, baja kumusanganira basemerera bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">“Hozana!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni ijambo ry’Igiheburayo risigura ngo “Dukize!” Ariko ryahavuye rikoreshwa mu gushimagiza Imana.</char></note></para>
  <para style="b" vid="JHN 12:13" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">“Hahezagirwe uwuje mw’izina ry’Uhoraho!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Zaburi 118:25</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:26">26</ref></char></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" vid="JHN 12:13" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">“Hahezagirwe umwami wa Isirayeli.”<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Nuko Yesu afata indogoba ayicarako, gutyo aba ashikije Ivyanditswe bivuga ngo:<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Ntutinye, Mukobwa w’i Siyoni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">raba, umwami wawe araje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">yicaye ku nyana y’indogoba.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zakariya 9:9</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Abigishwa ntibatahuye ubwo nyene ibiriko biraba. Ariko Yesu amaze kwinjira mu bwiza bwiwe, ni ho bibuka ko ivyo bamukoreye vyari vyaranditswe kuri we.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Isinzi ry’abantu bari kumwe na Yesu igihe yahamagara Lazaro ngo ave mu mva, akamuzura mu bapfuye, babandanije bakwiza inkuru y’ivyo babonye. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Ni co gituma abantu benshi barondera iyo ari. Bari bumvise ko yakoze ico gitangaza. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Nuko Abafarisayo baravugana bati: “Murabona ko ata co turiko turashikako. Isi yose iriko iramukurikira!”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu avuga ivyerekeye urupfu rwiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Mu bantu bari baje i Yerusalemu mu misi mikuru ya Pasika gusenga, harimwo Abagiriki. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Nuko begera Filipo yava i Betesayida mu ntara ya Galilaya baramubwira bati: “Nyakwubahwa, twipfuza kubona Yesu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filipo aca aragenda abibwira Andereya, maze uko ari babiri baca baja kubibwira Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesu aca ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Igihe kirashitse Umwana w’Umuntu ahabwe icubahiro ciwe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" /><char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, iyo urutete rw’ingano rudatewe mw’ivu ngo rupfe, ruguma ari rumwe gusa. Ariko iyo rutewe rugapfa, bituma rwama izindi ntete nyinshi cane.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" /><char style="wj">Umuntu wese akunda ubuzima bwiwe muri iyi si azobubura, ariko umuntu wese yanka ubuzima bwiwe muri iyi si azobuzigama ibihe bidashira.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" /><char style="wj">Nimba hariho umuntu ashaka kuba umwigishwa wanje ategerezwa kunkurikira, kuko umukozi wanje ategerezwa kuba aho ndi. Kandi Data azoha icubahiro umuntu wese ankorera.</char><verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />
    <char style="wj">Ubu ndumva mfise uruhagarara mu mutima, mbega mvuge iki? Mvuge nti: ‘Data, nkiza iyi saha’? Ariko iki ni co canzanye, iki gihe ni co canzanye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" /><char style="wj">Data, hesha izina ryawe icubahiro.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Nuko ijwi ryumvikana rivuye mw’ijuru riti: “Nararihesheje icubahiro, kandi nzosubira ndariheshe icubahiro.” <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Abantu benshi bari ngaho bumvise iryo jwi, bavuga ko ari umuturagaro, abandi na bo ngo ni umumarayika avuganye na we.<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Iryo jwi ntirivuze ku bwanje, ni ku bwanyu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" /><char style="wj">Igihe co gucira iyi isi urubanza kirageze; umutware wayo agira atererwe hanze.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" /><char style="wj">Kandi ninamara kumanikwa hejuru y’isi, nzokwiyegeranirizako abantu bose.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Ivyo yabivuze ashaka kwerekana urupfu yari agiye gupfa.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Abantu isinzi bari ngaho baramwishura bati: “Ivyagezwe bitubwira ko Kristo azokwamaho. None uvuze uti: <char style="wj">‘Umwana w’Umuntu azomanikwa hejuru’</char>? Uwo ‘Mwana w’Umuntu’ ni nde?”<verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Maze Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Umuco wanje usigaje igihe gito co kubaboneshereza. Nimugendere mu muco bigishoboka, umwijima utarabahwikira. Umuntu wese agendera mu mwijima ntashobora kumenya iyo ariko araja.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" /><char style="wj">Nimwizere umuco mukiwufise, kugira ngo mube abana b’umuco.”</char> Ahejeje kuvuga ayo majambo, Yesu aca aragenda arabinyegeza.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukutizera kw’Abayuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Naho Yesu yakoreye ibitangaza vyinshi imbere y’abantu, benshi ntibamwizeye. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Ibi vyabaye kugira ngo ijambo ry’uwavugishwa n’Imana Yesaya rishike, aho yanditse avuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">“Mwami, ni nde yizeye Ubutumwa Bwiza twavuze?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">Ni ba nde Uhoraho yahishuriye ukuboko kwiwe kw’ubushobozi?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Yesaya 53:1</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Ni co gituma batashobora kwizera, kuko Yesaya yongeye yandika ati:<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Uhoraho yabagize impumyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">akomantaza imitima yabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">kugira ngo amaso yabo ntabone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">n’imitima yabo ntitahure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">ngo boye kumpindukirira nanje ngo ndabakize.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 6:10">Yesaya 6:10</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Ibi Yesaya yabivuze kuko yeretswe ibizoba muri kazoza, abona ubwiza bwa Yesu, maze amuvugako.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Ariko rero benshi baramwizeye, harimwo na bamwe mu bakuru b’Abayuda. Mugabo ntibavyemanga ku mugaragaro kubera batinya ko Abafarisayo bobirukana mw’isinagogi. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Ivyo vyaterwa n’uko bakunda gushimwa n’abantu kurusha gushimwa n’Imana.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Nuko Yesu arasemerera ati: <char style="wj">“Uwunyizera ntaba yizeye jewe gusa, ariko aba yizeye n’uwantumye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" /><char style="wj">Uwumbonye aba abonye uwantumye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" /><char style="wj">Naje nk’umuco uboneshereza iyi si, kugira ngo ntihagire abanyizera baguma mu mwijima.</char><verse eid="JHN 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />
    <char style="wj">Jewe sincira urubanza umuntu yumva amajambo yanje ntayashire mu ngiro. Kuko sinaje gucira isi urubanza, ahubwo naje gukiza isi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" /><char style="wj">Ariko uwutanyakiriye akanka n’amajambo yanje azotsindwa n’urubanza; amajambo nababwiye ni yo azomutsindisha ku musi wa nyuma.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" /><char style="wj">Sinavuze ivyo nigeneye. Data yantumye ni we yantegetse kuvuga amajambo yose navuze.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" /><char style="wj">Kandi ndazi ko ivyo ategeka bizana ubugingo budashira. Ivyo mvuga ndabivuga nk’uko Data yabintegetse.”</char><verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu yoza ibirenge vy’abigishwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Buca bagira umusi mukuru wa Pasika, Yesu yari azi ko igihe ciwe co kuva mw’isi ngo asubire kwa Se gishitse. Yari yarakunze abiwe bari mw’isi, kandi yarabakunze gushika ku mwanya wa nyuma.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Nuko ku mugoroba w’uwo musi, Yesu asangira n’abigishwa biwe, kandi Satani yari yamaze gushira muri Yuda, mwene Simoni Isikariyote, iciyumviro co kugurisha Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesu yari azi ko Se yamuhaye ububasha ku bintu vyose. Yari azi ko yaje ava ku Mana kandi ko yagira asubireyo. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Nuko arahaguruka ava ku meza, akura umutamana wiwe, afata igitambara co kwihanaguza aragikenyera. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Ahejeje, afata amazi ayasuka mw’ibesani, atangura kwoza ibirenge vy’abigishwa biwe, abihanaguza ca gitambara yakenyera.<verse eid="JHN 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Ashikiriye Simoni Petero, Petero aramubwira ati: “Mwami, ni wewe ugira unyoze ibirenge!”<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ntushobora gutahura ico ndiko ndakora ubu nyene, ariko uzogitahura hanyuma.”</char><verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Petero aramubwira ati: “Oya, wewe ntuzokwigera unyoza ibirenge!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ni ntakwoza ibirenge, nta co tuzoba duhuriyeko.”</char><verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simoni Petero na we ati: “Mwami, nimba ari uko rero ntunyoze ibirenge gusa, unyoze n’ibiganza n’umutwe na vyo.”<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Uwumaze kwoga umubiri wose, aba akeneye kwoga ibirenge gusa, kuko umubiri wiwe wose uba usukuye. Mwebwe muratunganye naho atari mwese.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yesu yari azi uwugiye kumugurisha, ni co gituma yavuze ko batari batunganye bose.<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Ahejeje kuboza ibirenge, aca yambara wa mutamana wiwe asubira mu cicaro ciwe. Arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Muratahuye ico ndabakoreye?</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" /><char style="wj">Munyita ‘Umwigisha n’Umwami,’ kandi ivyo muvuga ni vyo, kuko ni ko biri.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" /><char style="wj">Nimba jewe, Umwigisha wanyu n’Umwami wanyu, ndabogeje ibirenge, namwe mukwiye kwozanya ibirenge.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" /><char style="wj">Ndaberetse akarorero kugira ngo namwe mukore nk’uko nabakoreye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" /><char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, umukozi ntaruta shebuja, kandi intumwa ntiruta uwayitumye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" /><char style="wj">Ivyo murabimenye, ariko muzohezagirwa nimwabishira mu ngiro.</char><verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu avuga ko agiye kugurishwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />
    <char style="wj">Ibi sindabivuze kuri mwebwe mwese; kuko ndazi abo natoranije. Ariko ibi bishitsa Ivyanditswe bivuga ngo: ‘Uwo twasangiye ivyokurya vyanje, ni we yahindukiriye kungwanya.’</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">13:18 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">
        <char style="xt">
          <ref loc="PSA 41:9">Zaburi 41:9</ref>
        </char>
      </char>
    </note><verse eid="JHN 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />
    <char style="wj">Ndabibabwiye bitaraba, kugira ngo nivyashika muze mwizere ko ndi uwo ndi we.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" /><char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, umuntu wese yakira intumwa yanje aba anyakiriye; kandi uwunyakiriye aba yakiriye uwantumye.”</char><verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Yesu ahejeje kuvuga ayo majambo, agira uruhagarara mu mutima wiwe, maze abivuga icese, ati: <char style="wj">“Ndababwire ukuri, umwe muri mwebwe agiye kungurisha.”</char><verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Abigishwa barabana mu maso, bibaza uwo ariko aravuga. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Umwe muri bo, uwo Yesu yakunda, yari yegamiye mu gikiriza ca Yesu bari ku meza. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Simoni Petero amuvunira akagohe, amubwira ati: “Mubaze uwo ari we.”<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Na we yegamira Yesu aramubaza ati: “Mwami, ni nde?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ni uwo nza gukoreza umukate mw’isahani nkawumuha.”</char> Yesu ahejeje kuwukoza mw’isahani awuha Yuda, mwene Simoni Isikariyote. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Yuda amaze kurya uwo mukate, Satani aca amwinjiramwo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:27">Yesu aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nyarutsa ukore ico wateguye gukora.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Ariko mu bariko barasangira na we nta n’umwe yamenye igituma amubwiye ayo majambo. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Kubera Yuda ari we yari ajejwe ikigega, bamwe bibajije ko Yesu amusavye kugura ibikenewe vy’umusi mukuru, canke kugira ico aha abakene. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Yuda agiheza kurya wa mukate, aca arasohoka kandi hari mw’ijoro.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu avuga ko Petero ahava amwihakana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Yuda amaze kugenda, Yesu aca avuga ati: <char style="wj">“Umwana w’Umuntu agira ahabwe icubahiro, kandi n’Imana igira ihabwe icubahiro muri we.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" /><char style="wj">Kandi nimba Imana igira ihabwe icubahiro muri we, na yo igiye kumuha icubahiro vuba.</char><verse eid="JHN 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />
    <char style="wj">Bana banje, nsigaje igihe gito cane ndi kumwe namwe. Muzondondera, kandi nk’uko nabibwiye Abayuda, namwe ndabibabwiye: ntimushobora gushika aho ngiye kuja.</char><verse eid="JHN 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />
    <char style="wj">Ndabahaye icagezwe gishasha: Nimukundane. Nk’uko nabakunze, ni ko namwe mukwiye gukundana.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" /><char style="wj">Nimwakundana, bose bazomenya ko muri abigishwa banje.”</char><verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simoni Petero aramubaza ati: “Mwami, ugiye kuja he?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ntushobora kunkurikira aho ngiye, ariko uzonkurikira hanyuma.”</char><verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Petero aramubwira ati: “Mwami, ni kuki ntogukurikira ubu? Nditeguye no gupfa nzira wewe!”<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Gupfa uzira jewe? Ndakubwire ukuri, isake itarabika, uzoba umaze kunyihakana gatatu kose.”</char><verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahumuriza abigishwa biwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />
    <char style="wj">“Ntimuhagarike imitima yanyu, mwizere Imana kandi nanje munyizere.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" /><char style="wj">Mu rugo kwa Data hari amazu menshi, kandi ngiye kubategurira aho kuba. Iyo bitaba biri uko, nari kubibabwira.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" /><char style="wj">Ninaheza kubategurira aho kuba, nzogaruka kubatora, kugira ngo mubane nanje aho nzoba ndi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" /><char style="wj">Kandi murazi inzira ijayo.”</char><verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ni inzira, ukuri n’ubugingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Toma aramubaza ati: “Mwami, ntituzi iyo ugiye kuja, none twomenya inzira ijayo gute?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ni jewe nzira n’ukuri n’ubugingo. Nta n’umwe ashobora gushika kwa Data atanciyeko.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" /><char style="wj">Iyo muja kuba munzi vy’ukuri, mwari kuba muzi na Data. Noneho kuva ubu muramuzi kandi mwaramubonye.”</char><verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filipo aramubwira ati: “Mwami, twereke Data, ivyo bizoba bikwiye.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Filipo, inyuma y’iki gihe cose tumaranye, uracavuga ko utanzi? Uwumbonye wese aba abonye Data! None ni kuki uvuze uti: ‘Twereke Data’?</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" /><char style="wj">Mbega ntiwizera ko ndi muri Data, Data na we akaba muri jewe? Amajambo ndababwira si ayo nigenera, ahubwo Data ambamwo ni we akorera muri jewe igikorwa ciwe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" /><char style="wj">Nimube munyizera iyo ndababwiye ko ndi muri Data, Data na we akaba muri jewe; canke na ho, munyizere kubera ibikorwa mwabonye nkora.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" /><char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, uwunyizera wese azokora ibikorwa nk’ivyo nakoze, mbere azokora n’ibibiruta, kuko jewe ngiye kuja kwa Data.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" /><char style="wj">Ico muzosaba cose mw’izina ryanje nzogikora, kugira ngo Data ahabwe icubahiro biciye mu Mwana.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" /><char style="wj">Ni ukuri, ico muzosaba cose mw’izina ryanje, nzogikora.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asezerana kurungika Mpwemu Yera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />
    <char style="wj">Nimwaba munkunda, nimushire mu ngiro amabwirizwa yanje.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" /><char style="wj">Nanje nzosaba Data abahe uwundi Mwitsa azobana namwe ibihe vyose,</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" /><char style="wj">ni we Mpwemu w’ukuri. Isi ntishobora kumwakira, kuko itamubona kandi itamuzi. Ariko mwebwe muramuzi, kuko abana namwe kandi azoba muri mwebwe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" /><char style="wj">Sinzobasiga nk’impfuvyi; nzoza aho muri.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" /><char style="wj">Hasigaye igihe gito isi ntisubire kumbona, ariko mwebwe muzombona, kandi ko ndiho, namwe muzobaho.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" /><char style="wj">Uwo musi niwashika, muzotahura ko ndi muri Data, kandi ko namwe muri muri jewe, nanje nkaba muri mwebwe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" /><char style="wj">Umuntu wese yakira amabwirizwa yanje akayashira mu ngiro, ni we ankunda. Kandi uwunkunda Data azomukunda. Nanje nzomukunda ndanamwiyereke.”</char><verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Nuko Yuda (atari Isikariyote) aramubaza ati: “Mwami, ni kuki ushaka kwihishurira twebwe, aho kwihishurira isi?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Uwunkunda azoshira mu ngiro inyigisho zanje. Data azomukunda, kandi twe na Data tuzoza tubane na we.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" /><char style="wj">Uwutankunda ntazoshira mu ngiro inyigisho zanje. Kandi aya majambo mwumva si ayo nigeneye; ariko ni aya Data yantumye.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />
    <char style="wj">Ibi ndabibabwiye nkiri kumwe namwe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" /><char style="wj">Ariko Umwitsa, ari we Mpwemu Yera, uwo Data azorungika mw’izina ryanje, azobigisha vyose yongere abibutse ivyo nababwiye vyose.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" /><char style="wj">Amahoro yanje ndayabasigaranye, kandi amahoro yanje ndayabahaye. Jewe singaba nk’uko isi igaba. Ni co gituma mudakwiye guhagarika imitima canke ngo mugire ubwoba.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />
    <char style="wj">Mwibuke ivyo nababwiye: Ngiye kugenda ariko nzogaruka aho muri. Iyo muba munkunda, mwari kunezerezwa n’uko ngiye kuja kwa Data, kuko Data aranduta.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" /><char style="wj">Ibi ndabibabwiye bitaraba kugira ngo nivyashika muze mwizere.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" /><char style="wj">Nta mwanya ngifise wo kubabwira vyinshi, kuko umutware w’iyi si agira aze. Jewe nta bubasha amfiseko,</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" /><char style="wj">ariko aje kugira ngo isi imenye ko nkunda Data kandi ko nkora nk’uko Data yantegetse.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">
    <char style="wj">Nimuhaguruke tugende.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ni umuzabibu w’ukuri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />
    <char style="wj">Jewe ndi umuzabibu w’ukuri, Data na we ni we awitaho.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" /><char style="wj">Ishami ryose ryo kuri jewe ritama ararica, ariko ishami ryose ryama ararituturira akarituganya kugira ngo rirushirize kwama.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" /><char style="wj">Mwebwe muramaze gutungana kubera ijambo nababwiye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" /><char style="wj">Nimugume muri jewe, nanje ngume muri mwebwe. Nk’uko ishami ridashobora kwama riri ukwaryo, kiretse rigumye ku muzabibu, ni ko namwe mudashobora kwama mutagumye muri jewe.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />
    <char style="wj">Jewe ndi umuzabibu; namwe muri amashami. Nimwaguma muri jewe nanje nkaguma muri mwebwe, muzokwama ivyamwa vyinshi. Erega mutari kumwe nanje nta co mushobora gukora!</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" /><char style="wj">Uwutagumye muri jewe, ameze nk’ishami riterewe hanze rikuma; amashami ameze nk’iryo barayegeranya bakayaterera mu muriro agasha.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" /><char style="wj">Nimwaguma muri jewe, amajambo yanje akaguma muri mwebwe, muze musabe ico mushaka cose, kandi muzogihabwa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" /><char style="wj">Iyo mwamye ivyamwa vyinshi, muba mwerekanye ko muri abigishwa banje kandi ivyo bihesha Data icubahiro.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />
    <char style="wj">Nk’uko Data yankunze, ni ko nanje nabakunze, nuko rero nimugume mu rukundo rwanje.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" /><char style="wj">Nimwakurikiza amabwirizwa yanje, muzoguma mu rukundo rwanje, nk’uko nanje nakurikije amabwirizwa ya Data nkaguma mu rukundo rwiwe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" /><char style="wj">Ibi ndabibabwiye kugira ngo umunezero wanje ube muri mwebwe, kandi umunezero wanyu wuzure.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" /><char style="wj">Ibwirizwa ryanje ni iri: Nimukundane nk’uko nabakunze.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" /><char style="wj">Nta rukundo ruruta gutanga ubugingo bwawe ku bwa bagenzawe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" /><char style="wj">Muzoba muri abakunzi banje nimwakora ivyo ndabategeka.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" /><char style="wj">Sinkibita abakozi, kuko umukozi ntamenya ivyo shebuja akora. Mwebwe nabise abakunzi banje, kuko ivyo numvanye Data vyose nabibamenyesheje.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" /><char style="wj">Si mwebwe mwantoranije, ni jewe nabatoranije. Nabashizeho kugira ngo mugende mwame ivyamwa, kandi ivyamwa bihoraho, kugira ngo ico muzosaba Data cose mw’izina ryanje azokibahe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" /><char style="wj">Iri ni ryo bwirizwa ryanje: Nimukundane.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urwanko rw’isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />
    <char style="wj">Isi niyabanka, muze mwibuke ko yabanje kunyanka.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" /><char style="wj">Iyo muba ab’isi, yobakunze nk’abayo. Ariko ntimukiri ab’isi. Narabatoranije ndabakura muri yo, ni co gituma ibanka.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" /><char style="wj">Mwibuke ivyo nababwiye: ‘Umukozi ntaruta shebuja.’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 13:16">Yohana 13:16</ref></char></char></note> <char style="wj">Nimba barampamye, namwe bazobahama. Nimba barakurikije inyigisho zanje, bazokurikiza n’izanyu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" /><char style="wj">Ivyo bazobibakorera kubera jewe, kuko batazi uwantumye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" /><char style="wj">Iyo ntaza nkavugana na bo, ntibokwagirijwe icaha. Ariko noneho nta co bafise bireguza ku caha cabo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" /><char style="wj">Uwunyanka aba yanka na Data.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" /><char style="wj">Iyo ntakorera hagati muri bo ibitangaza ata muntu n’umwe yigeze akora, ntibokwagirijwe icaha. Ariko barabonye ivyo nakoze vyose, yamara baranyanse, banka na Data.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" /><char style="wj">Ibi bishitsa ivyanditswe mu Vyagezwe vyabo bivuga ngo: ‘Banyanse ata co bampoye.’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 35:19">Zaburi 35:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:4">69:4</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Igikorwa ca Mpwemu Yera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />
    <char style="wj">Ariko nzobarungikira Umwitsa, ari we Mpwemu w’ukuri azoza avuye kwa Data. Uwo niyaza, azonshingira intahe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" /><char style="wj">Kandi namwe muzonshingira intahe, kuko mwabanye nanje kuva mu ntango y’igikorwa canje.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />
    <char style="wj">Ibi ndabibabwiye kugira ngo ntimuzotakaze ukwizera nivyashika.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" /><char style="wj">Bazobirukana mu masinagogi, kandi igihe kiraje aho abazobica bazokwibaza ko bariko bakorera Imana.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" /><char style="wj">Ivyo bazobikora kuko batamenye Data nanje ntibamenye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" /><char style="wj">Ibi ndabibabwiye kugira ngo nivyashika, muze mwibuke ko nari narabibabwiye. Icatumye ntabibabwira mu ntango ni kuko nari nkiri kumwe namwe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" /><char style="wj">Ariko ubu ngiye gusubira ku wantumye, kandi nta n’umwe muri mwebwe ambajije iyo ngiye kuja.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" /><char style="wj">Yamara imitima yanyu yuzuye umubabaro kubera ivyo ndababwiye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" /><char style="wj">Ariko ndababwire ukuri, vyobabera vyiza ko ngenda, kuko nintagenda, Umwitsa ntazobazako. Ariko ninagenda, nzoca ndamubarungikira.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" /><char style="wj">Uwo niyaza, azokwemeza abantu b’iyi si ivy’icaha, ivy’ukugororoka hamwe n’ivy’urubanza.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" /><char style="wj">Ivy’icaha kuko banse kunyizera.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" /><char style="wj">Ivy’ukugororoka, kuboneka kuko ngiye gusubira kwa Data kandi mukaba mutazosubira kumbona.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" /><char style="wj">Ivy’urubanza, kuko umutware w’iyi si yamaze gutsindwa n’urubanza.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />
    <char style="wj">Mfise vyinshi nashaka kubabwira, ariko ntimushobora kuvyihanganira ubu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" /><char style="wj">Ariko Mpwemu w’ukuri niyaza, azobarongorera mu kuri kwose. Ntazovuga ivyo yigeneye; ahubwo azovuga ivyo yumvise gusa, kandi azobabwira ibigiye kuba.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" /><char style="wj">Azompesha icubahiro kuko azokwakira ivyanje akabibamenyesha.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" /><char style="wj">Ivya Data vyose ni ivyanje. Ni co gituma mvuze ko Mpwemu azokwakira ivyanje akabibamenyesha.”</char><verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umubabaro uzohinduka umunezero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />Yesu arabandanya ati: <char style="wj">“Hasigaye igihe gito ntimusubire kumbona, ariko inyuma y’igihe gito muzosubira mumbone.”</char><verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Bumvise ayo majambo, bamwe mu bigishwa baravugana bati: “Ashatse kuvuga iki? Ngo: <char style="wj">‘Hasigaye igihe gito ntimusubire kumbona, ariko inyuma y’igihe gito muzosubira mumbone’</char> kandi ngo: <char style="wj">‘Ngiye kuja kwa Data’</char>.” <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Barongera babazanya bati: <char style="wj">“ ‘Hasigaye igihe gito’</char> bisigura iki? Ntidutahura ico ashaka kuvuga.”<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Nuko Yesu abonye ko bafise ico bashaka kumubaza, arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Muriko mubazanya ico nashatse kuvuga aho navuga nti: ‘Hasigaye igihe gito ntimusubire kumbona, ariko inyuma y’igihe gito muzosubira mumbone’?</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" /><char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, muzorira mugandare, ariko isi yo izonezerwa. Muzogira umubabaro, ariko umubabaro wanyu uzohinduka umunezero.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" /><char style="wj">Iyo umugore agira yibaruke, agira umubabaro mwinshi kuko igihe ciwe co kwibaruka gishitse; ariko iyo umwana amaze kuvuka, yibagira wa mubabaro wiwe kuko anezerejwe no kubona ikibondo kivutse mw’isi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" /><char style="wj">Ni ko bimeze no kuri mwebwe: Iki ni igihe canyu c’umubabaro, ariko nitwasubira kubonana imitima yanyu izonezerwa, kandi nta n’umwe azoshobora kubatwara umunezero wanyu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" /><char style="wj">Uwo musi, nta kibazo na kimwe muzosubira kumbaza. Ndababwire ukuri, ico muzosaba Data cose mw’izina ryanje azokibaha.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" /><char style="wj">Gushika ubu nta kintu na kimwe murasaba mw’izina ryanje. Nimusabe muzohabwa, kugira ngo umunezero wanyu wuzure.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />
    <char style="wj">Ibi ndabibabwiye mu migani, ariko igihe kiraje aho ntazosubira kubigishiriza mu migani, ariko nzobabwira ivya Data ndabitomoye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" /><char style="wj">Muri ico gihe muzosaba mw’izina ryanje. Simvuze ko nzobavugira kuri Data.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" /><char style="wj">Oya, Data ubwiwe asanzwe abakunda kuko mwankunze, mukizera ko naje ntumwe n’Imana.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" /><char style="wj">Naje mva kwa Data nza mw’isi, none ngiye kuva mw’isi nsubire kwa Data.”</char><verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Maze abigishwa biwe baramubaza bati: “Ubu rero uriko uvuga udakoresheje imigani. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Turatahuye ko uzi vyose, kandi ko bidakenewe ko umuntu akubaza ibibazo. Ivyo bitumye twizera ko waje uva ku Mana.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ubu rero murizeye?</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" /><char style="wj">Igihe kiri hafi kandi kirashitse, aho mugiye gushwiragira, umwe wese afate inzira yiwe, munsige jenyene. Ariko sindi jenyene kuko Data ari kumwe nanje.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />
    <char style="wj">Ibi ndabibabwiye kugira ngo mugire amahoro muri jewe. Muri iyi si muzohagirira amarushwa menshi, ariko nimuhumure jewe naranesheje isi.”</char><verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu yisengera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yesu ahejeje kuvuga ayo amajambo, arangamiza mw’ijuru asenga ati:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="JHN 17:1">
    <char style="wj">“Data, igihe kirashitse. Nuheshe Umwana wawe icubahiro, kugira ngo na we aguheshe icubahiro.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" /><char style="wj">Wamuhaye ububasha ku bantu bose kugira ngo ahe ubugingo budashira abo wamuhaye bose.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" /><char style="wj">Ubu ni bwo bugingo budashira: ko bakumenya wewe, Imana y’ukuri yonyene, na Yesu Kristo, uwo watumye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" /><char style="wj">Naguhesheje icubahiro hano kw’isi mu kurangiza igikorwa wampaye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" /><char style="wj">None Data numpe ca cubahiro nari mfise ndi kumwe nawe imbere y’uko isi ibaho.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asengera abigishwa biwe</para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />
    <char style="wj">Narakumenyekanishije ku bo wampaye ubakuye mw’isi. Bari abawe urabampa, kandi bumviye ijambo ryawe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" /><char style="wj">Ubu barazi ko ivyo mfise vyose vyavuye iwawe,</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" /><char style="wj">kuko nabahaye amajambo wampaye kandi barayakira. Bamenye badakekeranya ko naje mva iwawe kandi bizeye ko ari wewe wantumye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" /><char style="wj">Ndabasengeye; sinsengeye isi, ariko nsengeye abo wampaye, kuko ari abawe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" /><char style="wj">Abanje bose ni abawe, kandi abawe bose ni abanje. Kandi icubahiro canje kigaragarira muri bo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" /><char style="wj">Jewe ngiye kuva mw’isi, nze aho uri, ariko bo baracari mw’isi. Data Wera, bazigamire mu bushobozi bw’izina ryawe, rimwe wampa, kugira ngo babe umwe nk’uko wewe nanje turi umwe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" /><char style="wj">Nkiri kumwe na bo, nabazigamiye mu bushobozi bw’izina ryawe, rimwe wampa. Narabarinze kandi nta n’umwe muri bo yazimiye kiretse umwe yategerezwa kuranduka kugira ngo Ivyanditswe bishike.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />
    <char style="wj">Data, ubu ndaje aho uri, ariko mvuze aya majambo nkiri mw’isi kugira ngo bagire umunezero wanje kandi bawugire wuzuye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" /><char style="wj">Nabahaye ijambo ryawe, kandi isi yarabanse kuko batakiri abayo, nk’uko nanje ntari uwayo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" /><char style="wj">Sindagusavye ngo ubakure mw’isi, ariko ndagusavye ngo ubarinde wa mubi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" /><char style="wj">Si ab’isi, nk’uko nanje ntari uwayo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" /><char style="wj">Bezeshe ukuri; ijambo ryawe ni ryo kuri.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" /><char style="wj">Nk’uko wantumye mw’isi, nanje ndabatumye mw’isi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" /><char style="wj">Ku bwabo ndiyeza, kugira ngo na bo bezwe mu kuri.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asengera abizera bose</para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />
    <char style="wj">Sinsengeye aba gusa. Ariko ndasengeye n’abandi bose bazokwizera biciye ku butumwa bw’aba.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" /><char style="wj">Ndabasengeye ngo bose babe umwe; nk’uko wewe Data uri muri jewe nanje nkaba muri wewe, nibabe umwe muri twebwe, kugira ngo isi yizere ko wantumye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" /><char style="wj">Icubahiro wampaye narakibahaye, kugira ngo babe umwe nk’uko twe nawe turi umwe:</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" /><char style="wj">jewe mbe muri bo, nawe ube muri jewe, aho ni ho bazoba umwe vy’ukuri, kugira ngo isi imenye ko wantumye kandi ko ubakunda nk’uko unkunda.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />
    <char style="wj">Data, ndashaka ko abo wampaye babana nanje aho ndi, kugira ngo babone ubwiza bwanje, bumwe wampa, kuko wankunze isi itararemwa.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />
    <char style="wj">Data ugororotse, naho isi itakuzi, jewe ndakuzi, kandi aba barazi ko ari wewe wantumye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" /><char style="wj">Narakumenyekanishije muri bo, kandi nzobandanya ndakumenyekanisha kugira ngo urukundo unkunda rube muri bo kandi nanje mbe muri bo.”</char><verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Bafata Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Yesu ahejeje gusenga, ajabuka umwonga wa Kidironi ari kumwe n’abigishwa biwe, baja mw’itongo ryari hakurya.<verse eid="JHN 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yuda, yamugurisheje, aho hantu yari ahazi, kuko Yesu yakunda kujana n’abigishwa biwe muri iryo tongo. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Nuko Yuda aja muri iryo tongo, ajanye n’umugwi w’abasoda n’abarinzi b’urusengero barungitswe n’abaherezi bakurubakuru n’Abafarisayo. Bari bafise ibimuri, amatara n’ibigwanisho.<verse eid="JHN 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Maze, kuko Yesu yari azi ibigiye kumushikira, arabegera arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Murondera nde?”</char><verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Baramwishura bati: “Yesu w’i Nazareti.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Na we ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ni jewe.”</char> Kandi Yuda, uwagira amugurishe, yari ahagararanye na bo. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Yesu avuze ati: <char style="wj">“Ni jewe,”</char> baca bagenza umugongo, baratemba.<verse eid="JHN 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Yesu yongera arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Murondera nde?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Baramwishura bati: “Yesu w’i Nazareti.”<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Na we abishura ati: <char style="wj">“Nababwiye ko ari jewe. Nimba ari jewe murondera, nimureke aba turi kumwe bigire.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Ivyo yabikoze kugira ngo ashitse ico yari yavuze, aho yavuga ati: <char style="wj">“Sinazimije n’umwe mu bo wampaye.”</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 6:39">Yohana 6:39</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Maze Simoni Petero, yari asanganywe inkota, arayisokora, ayikubita umukozi w’umuherezi mukuru, amuca ugutwi. (Uwo mukozi yitwa Malikusi.)<verse eid="JHN 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Yesu aca abwira Petero ati: <char style="wj">“Subiza inkota mu rwubati. Mbega sinkwiye kunywa ku gikombe c’umubabaro Data yampaye?”</char><verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Nuko wa mugwi w’abasoda n’umukuru wabo hamwe na ba barinzi b’urusengero bafata Yesu baramuboha, <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />babanza kumujana kwa Anasi, sebukwe wa Kayafa, umuherezi mukuru wo muri uwo mwaka. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Kayafa ni we yari yahanuye abakuru b’Abayuda ababwira ko vyoba vyiza ko umuntu umwe apfira abantu.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero yihakana Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Nuko Simoni Petero n’uwundi mwigishwa bakurikira Yesu. Uwo mwigishwa wundi yari azwi n’umuherezi mukuru, ivyo vyatumye yemererwa kwinjirana na Yesu mu rugo rw’umuherezi mukuru, <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />ariko Petero we asigara hanze. Maze wa mwigishwa yari azwi n’umuherezi mukuru aragaruka avugana n’umukobwa yarinda umuryango, na we yemerera Petero kwinjira.<verse eid="JHN 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Wa mukobwa arinda umuryango abaza Petero ati: “Ubwo wewe nturi umwe mu bigishwa b’uwu mugabo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Petero aramwishura ati: “Oya sindi we.”<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Kubera hari hakanye, abakozi n’abarinzi baciye bacana umuriro, bahagarara i ruhande yawo bota. Petero na we nyene ahagararana na bo yota.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umuherezi mukuru asambisha Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Ico gihe, umuherezi mukuru yariko arasambisha Yesu ku vyerekeye abigishwa biwe n’inyigisho ziwe.<verse eid="JHN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Imisi yose navuganye n’abantu bose ku mugaragaro. Nigishirije mu masinagogi no mu rusengero, aho abantu bakoranira. Nta kintu na kimwe navuze ninyegeje.</char> <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" /><char style="wj">Ni kuki munsambisha? Nimubaze abanyumvirije; barazi ivyo navuze.”</char><verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Yesu ahejeje kuvuga ayo majambo, umwe mu barinzi bari bahagaze hafi yiwe amukubita ikofe mu maso, aramubaza ati: “Uko ni ko wishura umuherezi mukuru?”<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ninaba mvuze ibinyoma, vyerekane. Ariko nimba mvuze ukuri, unkubitiye iki?”</char> <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Nuko Anasi aca arungika Yesu aboshwe kwa Kayafa, umuherezi mukuru.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero asubira kwihakana Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Ico gihe, Simoni Petero yari agihagaze ha handi yota umuriro. Nuko baramubwira bati: “Wewe utegerezwa kuba uri umwe mu bigishwa biwe!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Na we arabihakana ati: “Sindi we.”<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Umwe mu bakozi b’umuherezi mukuru yari incuti ya wa muntu Petero yaca ugutwi aramubwira ati: “Wewe sinakubonye uri kumwe na we muri rya tongo?” <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Petero yongera kubihakana, maze uwo mwanya nyene isake ica irabika.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu imbere ya Pilato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Urubanza rwa Yesu imbere ya Kayafa rwaheze kare mu gitondo. Mu nyuma baciye bamujana ku kirimba c’uwaserukira ubwami bw’Abaroma. Ariko abakuru b’Abayuda ntibinjiye kuko banka kwihumanya kugira ngo bashobore guhimbaza umusi mukuru wa Pasika. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Nuko Pilato arasohoka aja aho bari, arababaza ati: “Uwu muntu mumwagiriza iki?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Baramwishura bati: “Ntitwari kumukuzanira ata kimwagira.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilato arababwira ati: “Nimumujane mwebwe nyene mumucire urubanza mukurikije amategeko yanyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Baramwishura bati: “Ntitwemerewe gucira umuntu urubanza rwo gupfa.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Ibi vyabaye kugira ngo bishitse ico Yesu yari yaravuze igihe yavuga urupfu yari agiye gupfa.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Nuko Pilato asubira mu ngoro, ahamagara Yesu, aramubaza ati: “Uri Umwami w’Abayuda?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu aramubaza ati: <char style="wj">“Ibi ubibajije bivuye muri wewe canke ni ivyo wumvise abandi bamvugako?”</char><verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilato aramwishura ati: “Ubona jewe ndi Umuyuda? Abo mu bwoko bwawe n’abaherezi bakurubakuru banyu ni bo bakunzaniye. Wagirizwa iki?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu amubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ubwami bwanje si ubwo muri iyi si. Iyo buba ubwo muri iyi si, abayoboke banje bari kungwanira bakabuza abakuru b’Abayuda kumfata. Ariko Ubwami bwanje si ubwo muri iyi si.”</char><verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Pilato aramubwira ati: “Urumva rero uri Umwami!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Uvuze ukuri, ndi Umwami. Icatumye mvuka nkaza kw’isi kwari ukugira ngo nshingire intahe ukuri. Umuntu wese akunda ukuri aranyumviriza.”</char><verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilato aramubaza ati: “Ukuri ni iki?” Ahejeje kuvuga ivyo, aca arasohoka aja aho Abayuda bari bakoraniye, ababwira ati: “Nta kintu na kimwe kimwagira. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Ariko musanzwe mufise umugenzo wo kunsaba imbohe imwe mu gihe c’imisi mikuru ya Pasika. Mushaka ko ndabarekurira ‘umwami w’Abayuda’?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Barasemerera bati: “Oya, si we dushaka! Turekurire Baraba!” Uwo Baraba yari umugumutsi.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="s1">Bacira Yesu urubanza rwo kubambwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Nuko Pilato afata Yesu ategeka ko bamutonagura. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Abasoda bajisha urugori rw’amahwa, barumwambika mu mutwe, bamwambika n’impuzu y’ubwami, <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />bamukuranwako bavuga bati: “Turagize bwakeye, mwami w’Abayuda!” Bongera bamukubita mu maso.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilato yongera gusohoka abwira Abayuda bari bakoraniye aho ati: “Ngira ndamusohore ndamubazanire, ariko mumenye ko ata kibi na kimwe nasanze kimwagira.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Nuko Yesu asohoka yambaye urugori rw’amahwa ku mutwe n’impuzu y’ubwami. Pilato arababwira ati: “Ng’uwu wa muntu!”<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Abaherezi bakurubakuru n’abarinzi b’urusengero bamubonye, barasemerera bati: “Nabambwe! Nabambwe!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Pilato arabishura ati: “Nimumujane mwebwe mumwibambire kuko ata kibi na kimwe nasanze kimwagira.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Abakuru b’Abayuda baramwishura bati: “Dukurikije ivyagezwe vyacu, akwiye gupfa kuko yiyise Umwana w’Imana.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Pilato yumvise ayo majambo, agira ubwoba bwinshi. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Aca asubiza Yesu mu kirimba, aramubaza ati: “Uri uwa he?” Ariko Yesu ntiyagira ico amwishura. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Pilato aramubaza ati: “Ni kuki utanyishura? Ntuzi ko mfise ububasha bwo kukurekura canke kukubamba?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Nta bubasha wari umfiseko iyo utabuhabwa n’Imana. Ni co gituma uwakunshikirije yakoze icaha kiruta icawe.”</char><verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Kuva ako kanya, Pilato agerageza kurekura Yesu, ariko abakuru b’Abayuda babandanya basemerera bati: “Niwarekura uwo muntu, ntuzoba ukiri umugenzi wa Kayisari. Umuntu wese yiyita umwami aba agararije Kayisari.”<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Pilato yumvise ayo majambo, asohora Yesu, yicara ku ntebe y’imanza, ahantu hitwa Umusezero w’Amabuye (mu rurimi rw’Igiheburayo hitwa Gabata). <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Hari nk’isaha zitandatu ku musi wo kwitegurira Pasika.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:14">Nuko Pilato abwira Abayuda ati: “Ng’uwu umwami wanyu!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Barasemerera bati: “Napfe! Napfe! Nabambwe!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pilato arababaza ati: “Mushaka ko mbamba umwami wanyu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Abaherezi bakurubakuru baramwishura bati: “Nta wundi mwami dufise atari Kayisari.”<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Pilato aca atanga Yesu kugira ngo bamubambe.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 19:16">Ukubambwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Nuko baramufata baramujana. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Yesu asohoka yikoreye umusaraba wiwe, ajanwa ahantu hitwa Nyagihanga (mu Giheburayo hitwa Gologota). <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Aho ni ho bamubamvye. Hariho n’abandi bantu babiri babambanywe na we, umwe hirya uwundi hino, Yesu na we bamushira hagati.<verse eid="JHN 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Maze Pilato azana icandiko, ategeka ko bakimanika ku musaraba. Ico candiko cavuga ngo:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="JHN 19:19">
    <char style="sc">Yesu w’i Nazareti, umwami w’Abayuda.</char><verse eid="JHN 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Abayuda benshi barasomye ico candiko, kuko aho Yesu yari abambwe hari hegereye igisagara, kandi ico candiko cari canditswe mu Giheburayo, mu Kilatini no mu Kigiriki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Abaherezi bakurubakuru babwira Pilato bati: “Reka kwandika ngo: ‘Umwami w’Abayuda,’ hindura wandike uti: yavuze ngo ni umwami w’Abayuda.”<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilato arabishura ati: “Ico nanditse, nacanditse.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Bahejeje kubamba Yesu, abasoda bafata impuzu ziwe bazigaburamwo kune, umusoda wese atwara umuce, basigaza ikanzu yiwe. Iyo kanzu ntiyagira umubaririro, yari igizwe n’igitambara kimwe kuva hejuru gushika hasi.<verse eid="JHN 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Baravugana bati: “Ntidukwiye kuyitabura. Reka tuyipfindire kugira ngo tumenye uwuyegukira.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Zaburi 22:18</ref></char></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:24">Ibi vyabaye kugira ngo bishitse Ivyanditswe bivuga ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">“Bagabuye impuzu zanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">bapfindira umutamana wanje.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Ivyo ni vyo abasoda bakoze.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Hafi y’umusaraba wa Yesu, hari hahagaze nyina, nyinabo, Mariya muka Kilopa na Mariya Magadalena. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yesu abonye nyina ahagaze aho, na wa mwigishwa Yesu yakunda amwegereye, abwira nyina ati: <char style="wj">“Muvyeyi, ng’uwo umwana wawe,”</char> <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />abwira wa mwigishwa ati: <char style="wj">“Ng’uwo umuvyeyi wawe.”</char> Kuva ico gihe, wa mwigishwa aca ajana Mariya iwe.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urupfu rwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Inyuma y’ivyo, Yesu amenye ko vyose birangiye, kandi kugira ngo Ivyanditswe bishike, aravuga ati: <char style="wj">“Ndanyotewe.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Hafi yaho hari umubindi urimwo inkarisha, maze abasoda bafata sipongo bayijobeka muri ya nkarisha, bayidugisha ishami rya ezobu ku munwa wa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yesu amaze kwumviriza kuri ya nkarisha, aravuga ati: <char style="wj">“Birarangiye.”</char> Nuko ajondamika umutwe aracikana.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Kubera ko wari umusi wo kwitegurira Isabato idasanzwe, kuko bwaca ari Pasika; abakuru b’Abayuda ntibashaka ko abantu baguma bamanitse ku misaraba ku musi w’Isabato. Ni co catumye basaba Pilato ko babavuna amaguru, bakururutsa ibiziga vyabo. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Nuko abasoda baraza bavuna amaguru ya bamwe babiri bari babambanywe na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Ariko bashikiriye Yesu basanga yamaze gucikana, ntibaba bakimuvuna amaguru. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Umwe mu basoda acumita Yesu icumu mu rubavu, haseseka amaraso n’amazi. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Uwabibonye ni we yabishingiye intahe, kandi intahe yiwe ni iy’ukuri, kandi ashinga iyo ntahe kugira ngo mwizere. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Ibi vyabaye kugira ngo hashitswe Ivyanditswe bivuga ngo: “Nta na rimwe mu magufa yiwe rizovunika.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Kuvayo 12:46</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 9:12">Guharura 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:20">Zaburi 34:20</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Ahandi Ivyanditswe bivuga ngo: “Bazobona uwo bacumise.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zakariya 12:10</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uguhambwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Inyuma y’ivyo, Yosefu w’i Arimataya asaba Pilato uruhusha rwo kumanura ikiziga ca Yesu. Uwo Yosefu yari umwigishwa wa Yesu, ariko mu mpisho, kuko yatinya abakuru b’Abayuda. Pilato amwemereye, Yosefu araza ajana ikiziga ca Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Yari kumwe na Nikodemu, umwe yagendera Yesu mw’ijoro. Nikodemu yari yaje azanye nk’ibiro mirongo itatu vy’ibimota neza. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Nuko bafata ikiziga ca Yesu bakizingira mu bitambara vyera, bashiramwo na vya bimota neza, nk’uko Abayuda babigenza mu guhamba. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Hafi y’aho Yesu yabambwe hari itongo, kandi muri iryo tongo hari imva nshasha, itari bwigere ihambwamwo umuntu. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Kubera wari umusi wo kwitegurira Isabato y’Abayuda, kandi iyo mva ikaba yari hafi, Yosefu na Nikodemu baciye baryamika ikiziga ca Yesu muri iyo mva.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ukuzuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Kare mu gitondo ku musi wa mbere w’iyinga, mu bucagucagu, Mariya Magadalena yazindutse ku mva asanga ca kibuye cari cugaye imva cakuweho. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Nuko ariruka aja kurondera Simoni Petero na wa mwigishwa wundi Yesu yakunda, arababwira ati: “Bakuye Umwami mu mva, kandi ntituzi iyo bamushize.”<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Petero n’uwo mwigishwa wundi bafata inzira baja ku mva. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Uko ari babiri bagiye biruka, ariko wa mwigishwa wundi ariruka asiga Petero, ashika ku mva ubwa mbere. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Maze arunama araba mu mva, abonayo vya bitambara vyera ariko ntiyinjira. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Simoni Petero na we ashika inyuma yiwe, yinjira mu mva, abonayo vya bitambara vyera, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />hamwe n’igitambara cari kizingiriye ku mutwe wa Yesu. Ico gitambara cari ukwaco kizinguruye. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Mu nyuma, wa mwigishwa yashika ku mva ubwa mbere na we yinjira mu mva, aravyibonera kandi arizera. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />(Gushika ico gihe abigishwa ntibari bwatahure Ivyanditswe bivuga ko Yesu yategerezwa kuzuka mu bapfuye.) <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Maze ba bigishwa baca basubira i muhira.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yiyereka Mariya Magadalena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Ariko Mariya yari ahagaze hanze, hafi y’imva, arira. Akiriko ararira arunama araba mu mva, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />abona abamarayika babiri bambaye impuzu zera, bicaye aho ikiziga ca Yesu cari kiryamye, umwe ahari umutwe, uwundi ahari ibirenge.<verse eid="JHN 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Baramubaza bati: “Mupfasoni, ni kuki uriko urarira?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Arabishura ati: “Batwaye Umwami wanje, kandi sinzi aho bamushize.” <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Ahejeje kuvuga ivyo, arahindukira abona Yesu ahagaze hafi yiwe, ariko ntiyamumenya.<verse eid="JHN 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesu aramubaza ati: <char style="wj">“Mupfasoni, ni kuki uriko urarira? Urondera nde?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Mariya yiyumviriye ko ari umurimyi wo muri iryo tongo, aramubwira ati: “Nyakwubahwa, nimba ari wewe wamutwaye, mbwira aho wamushize nje kumutora.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu aca aramuhamagara ati: <char style="wj">“Mariya.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Na we arahindukira aramuraba, aca arasemerera mu rurimi rw’Igiheburayo ati: <char style="tl">“Rabuni!”</char> (bisigura “Mwigisha”).<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ntumfate ngo ungumye, kuko ntaraja kwa Data. Ahubwo genda ubwire bene Data ko navuze ko, ‘Nduze kwa Data ari we So, Imana yanje ari yo Mana yanyu.’ ”</char><verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Mariya Magadalena aca aja aho abigishwa bari bari uwo mwanya ababwira ati: “Nabonye Umwami!” Aca ababwira ivyo Yesu yamubwiye.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yiyereka abigishwa biwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Ku mugoroba w’uwo musi, ari wo musi wa mbere w’indwi, abigishwa bari bakoraniye hamwe biyugaranye kuko batinya abakuru b’Abayuda. Maze Yesu araza ahagarara hagati muri bo, arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Amahoro abane namwe!”</char> <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Ahejeje kuvuga ivyo, abereka ibiganza vyiwe n’urubavu rwiwe. Abigishwa baranezerwa cane babonye Umwami.<verse eid="JHN 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesu yongera kubabwira ati: <char style="wj">“Amahoro abane namwe! Nk’uko Data yantumye, ni ko nanje ndabatumye.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Ahejeje kuvuga ivyo, abahumekerako, ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nimwakire Mpwemu Yera.</char> <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" /><char style="wj">Umuntu wese muzoharira ivyaha, azobiharirwa; kandi uwo mutazobiharira, ntazobiharirwa.”</char><verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yiyereka Toma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Toma (uwari azwi ko ari Ihasa), umwe muri ba bigishwa cumi na babiri, ntiyari kumwe n’abandi bigishwa igihe Yesu yaza. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Abandi bigishwa baramubwira bati: “Twabonye Umwami!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Ariko we ababwira ati: “Ivyo sinshobora kuvyemera ntiboneye inkovu z’imisumari mu biganza, nkazikozako urutoke rwanje, ngashira n’ikiganza canje mu nkovu yo mu rubavu rwiwe.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Haheze indwi, abigishwa ba Yesu basubira gukoranira hamwe mu nzu, kandi na Toma yari kumwe na bo. Imiryango y’inzu yari yugaye, ariko Yesu araza ahagarara hagati yabo, arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Amahoro abane namwe!”</char> <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Maze abwira Toma ati: <char style="wj">“Koza urutoke rwawe hano, urabe ibiganza vyanje. Gorora ukuboko kwawe ukore mu rubavu rwanje. Reka gukekeranya niwizere.”</char><verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Toma aramubwira ati: “Mwami wanje, Mana yanje!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yesu aramubwira ati: “Wizeye kubera umbonye? Hahiriwe abizera batabanje kubona.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Intumbero y’Ubutumwa Bwiza bwanditswe na Yohana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Hari n’ibindi bitangaza vyinshi Yesu yakoreye mu maso y’abigishwa biwe bitanditswe muri iki gitabu. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Ariko ibi vyanditswe kugira ngo mwizere ko Yesu ari Kristo, Umwana w’Imana, kandi kugira ngo mumaze kwizera, muronke ubugingo mw’izina ryiwe.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu yiyereka abigishwa biwe ku kiyaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Inyuma y’ivyo, Yesu yiyereka abigishwa biwe ku kiyaga c’i Tiberiya. Nguku uko vyagenze: <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simoni Petero, Toma (uwari azwi ko ari Ihasa), Natanayeli w’i Kana i Galilaya, abahungu ba Zebedayo, n’abandi bigishwa babiri bari kumwe. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simoni Petero arababwira ati: “Jewe ngiye kuroba.” Na bo baramubwira bati: “Turajana.” Nuko baragenda baja mu bwato, ariko ntibaroba ifi n’imwe iryo ijoro.<verse eid="JHN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Kare mu gitondo, Yesu ahagarara ku nkengera y’ikiyaga, ariko ba bigishwa ntibashobora kumenya uwo ari we.<verse eid="JHN 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Arabahamagara ati: <char style="wj">“Bagenzi, nta fi mufise?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Na bo bati: “Oya!”<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nimuterere urusenga ku ruhande rw’i buryo bw’ubwato, muraronka.”</char> Nuko baterera urusenga, maze ntibashobora kurukwega kubera ifi zari nyinshi.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Wa mwigishwa Yesu yakunda abwira Petero ati: “Ni Umwami!” Simoni Petero yumvise ko ari Umwami, aca yambara impuzu yiwe yo hejuru (kuko yari yayikuye), asimbira mu mazi. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Abandi bigishwa bagumye mu bwato bakwegera rwa rusenga rwuzuye ifi ku nkengera, kuko bari nko ku ntambuko ijana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 90.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Bururutse ubwato babona umuriro w’amakara wokejeko ifi, babona n’imikate.<verse eid="JHN 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nimuzane zimwe muri izo muhejeje kuroba.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Nuko Simoni Petero asubira mu bwato akwegera ku nkengera y’ikiyaga rwa rusenga rwuzuye ifi nininini, zishika ijana na mirongo itanu na zitatu. Ariko naho zari nyinshi, urusenga ntirwatabutse. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nimuze mufungure.”</char> Nta n’umwe muri ba bigishwa yubahutse kumubaza uwo ari we, kuko bari batahuye ko ari Umwami. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Nuko Yesu arabegera, abagaburira wa mukate, abaha n’ifi. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Ubwo bwagira gatatu Yesu yiyereka abigishwa inyuma yo kuzuka kwiwe.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Petero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Bahejeje gufungura, Yesu abwira Simoni Petero ati: <char style="wj">“Simoni mwene Yohana, urankunda kurusha aba?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Petero aramwishura ati: “Egome, Mwami, urazi ko ndagukunda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Yesu na we ati: <char style="wj">“Gaburira imyagazi y’intama zanje.”</char><verse eid="JHN 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Yesu yongera kubaza Petero ati: <char style="wj">“Simoni mwene Yohana, urankunda?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Aramwishura ati: “Egome, Mwami, urazi ko ndagukunda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Yesu aca amubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ragira intama zanje.”</char><verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Yesu amubaza ubugira gatatu Yesu ati: <char style="wj">“Simoni mwene Yohana, mbega urankunda?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Petero aca arababara kuko Yesu amubajije ubugira gatatu ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega urankunda?”</char> Aramwishura ati: “Mwami, wewe uzi vyose, urazi ko ndagukunda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yesu arongera amubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Gaburira intama zanje.</char> <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" /><char style="wj">Ndakubwire ukuri, ukiri muto wariyambika ukaja aho ushaka; ariko niwasaza, uzogorora amaboko yawe, uwundi muntu akwambike akujane aho udashaka kuja.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Yesu yavuze ivyo ashaka kwerekana Petero urupfu azopfa ahesha Imana icubahiro. Aca abwira Petero ati: <char style="wj">“Nkurikira!”</char><verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Nuko Petero arahindukira abona wa mwigishwa Yesu yakunda ariko arabakurikira. (Uwo ni umwe yari yegamiye mu gikiriza ca Yesu bariko barafungura akamubaza ati: “Mwami, ni nde agiye kukugurisha?”) <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Petero amubonye abaza Yesu ati: “Mwami, urya we ivyiwe bizogenda gute?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Nimba nshaka ko abaho gushika ngarutse, ivyo bigutwaye iki? Wewe nkurikira gusa.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Ivyo vyatumye haba ibihuha hagati mu bizera ko uwo mwigishwa atazopfa. Ariko Yesu ntiyavuze ngo ntazopfa; yavuze ati: <char style="wj">“Nimba nshaka ko abaho gushika ngarutse, ivyo bigutwaye iki?”</char><verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Uwo mwigishwa ni we ashingira intahe ivyo kandi ni na we yavyanditse. Kandi turazi ko intahe yiwe ari iy’ukuri.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Yesu yarakoze n’ibindi bintu vyinshi. Iyo vyose vyandikwa, nibaza ko n’isi yose itokwiwemwo ibitabu vyokwanditswe.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>